<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Bondei Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Maliko</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mbui Yedi inga yekuandikwavyo ni Maliko</para>
  <para style="toc2">Maliko</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mako</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mbui Yedi inga yekuandikwavyo ni</para>
  <para style="mt1">Maliko</para>
  <para style="imt">Uwongoezi</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbui Yedi kulawana na Maliko ni mwenga aho ya vitabu vine mwe agane dihya, vigombekavyo ugima wa Yesu Klistu. Kiya yumwe aho etangwa mbui ntana ionyeshayo Mbui Zedi na zekuandikwazo bada ya ufe wa Yesu na Matayo, Maiko, Luka na Yohana.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbui Yedi kulawana na Maliko ni njihi muno kusima zose nne. Yagombekwa kuwa iyandikwa bada ya kuvyaigwa Yesu, wekusomao wangi wamba iyandikwa uko Lumi kwa kusudi da kukunda waklistu wa Kilumi uko. Maliko amanyika inga Yohana Maliko nekawa hamwe na muagiiwa Paolo na Balinaba, akini ntunyo yakwe iumizwa kisingi kabada ntambo yao ya kuambaza Mbui ya Muungu Ntendwa 13:13 badae Maliko akamanyika inga mmbuya wahehi wa Petulo 1 Petulo 5:13. Inga Maliko khekumwona Yesu akini wekusomao wazumiiya na nee wamba Maliko kaandika mbui nyingi mno za Petulo na ido ne vokeo da Mbui Yedi, kuigana na Maliko mwe Mbui ya Maliko amanya uhina wakwe kwa Yesu kisingi cha kisikizi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yeumondani</para>
  <para style="io">Maliko ivokea mwe kitabu cha Maliko 1:1-13.</para>
  <para style="io">Naho Maliko atiambiza mbui za Yesu kisingi ekuwaho Galilaya, Maliko 1:14 - 8:21.</para>
  <para style="io">Naho ahadisia uwanga ya ntambo ya Yesu kuita Yelusalemu mwe Maliko 8:22 - 10:52.</para>
  <para style="io">Maliko abindiza kwa kuandika kisingi Yesu uko Yelusalemu hamwe na ufe wakwe na kuyuyuka, Maliko 11:1 - 16:8.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Yohana Mbatiiza abiikia wantu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matayo 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohana 1:19-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Inu ni Mbui Yedi ya Yesu Klistu, Mwana wa Muungu. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Ivoka inga yekuandikwavyo he kitabu cha muoni wa Muungu etangwaye Isaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">“Muungu akagombeka, ‘Namuagiiya mndima yangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">Akuongwee, endaye akugoswee sia yako.’<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Mgutio wa mntu wetanga mwenyika ‘Mgosoeyani Zumbe sia yakwe Nyooshani myemboko yakwe.’”<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Yohana mbatiiza kalawiiya mwe nyika, akawabiikia wantu na kuwabatiiza na kuwamba, “Waeke mavigaviga na Muungu endaawaekee mavigaviga yao.” <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Wantu wose kulawa si ya Uyahudi na wada wa mzi wa Yelusalemu, wakambasa kumtegeeza Yohana na kubada mavigaviga yao, nee wabatizwa mwe zigizigi da mazi Yolodani.<verse eid="MRK 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Yohana kavaa gwanda dekugosolwado na mazoya ya mnyama mwetangwa ngamia, na mshipi wa babu mwe kigudi chakwe, naho khande yakwe ne nsige na woki. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Akawamba wantu, “Eza mntu kwe mgongo wangu mwenye udaho kusima miye. Naho miye khikundigwa ata kwenama na kuchopoa sigi za sabana zakwe. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Miye nabatiiza kwa mazi, akini yee endaawabatiize kwa Muye wa Muungu.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubatiizwa na kugeezwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:13">Matayo 3:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 4:11">4:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luka 3:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4:1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Misi ida Yesu akatimia kulawa Nazaleti mzi wa Galilaya, akabatizwa ni Yohana mwe zigizigi da mazi Yolodani. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Ahoaho ekulawaho mwe mazi, Yesu akaona uwanga kwa Muungu kuvuguka na Muye wa Muungu ukaseeya inga suwa uwanga yakwe. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Mgutio ukategeezeka kulawa uwanga kwa Muungu, “Uyu ne mwanangu nimkundaye, nitamiwaye naye.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Ahoaho Muye wa Muungu ukamuongoeeya kuita he kiwawe. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Akekaa uko kwa misi makumi mane, akageezwa ni Ibiisi. Kekaa uko hamwe na wanyama wa mzituni, naho wandima wa uwanga wa Muungu wamuambiza.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awetanga walowa wane</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Matayo 4:12-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luka 4:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5:1-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Yohana ekuikwaho mwe kifungo, Yesu akaita mwe si ya Galilaya, akabiikia Mbui Yedi ya Muungu. <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />Akagombeka, “Kisingi kibua, Useuta wa Muungu uhehi! Hitukani mzumiiye Mbui Yedi!”<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Naho Yesu ekuwaho akemboka khandakhanda ya tondoo da mazi ya Galilaya, nee awaona wavuvi waidi, Simoni na nduguye Anduleya, walowa samaki.<figure style="fig" file="07 Fishing.jpg" size="col" ref="1:16">Mntu alowa samaki kwa kutumia nyavu</figure> <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Yesu akawamba, “Nitongeani miye, nendaniwatende muwaete wantu kwangu inga walowa waetavyo samaki.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Aho wakazibada nyavu zao wakamtongea.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Ekuitaho mbee kidodo nee awaona Yakobo na nduguye Yohana wana wa Zebedayo. Wowo pia newawa mwe ngaawa yao, naho ne wakagosoa nyavu zao. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Ahoaho Yesu akawetanga, wakambada tati yao Zebedayo mwe ngaawa hamwe na wandima wakwe na kumtongea Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amhonya mntu mwenye mazaiko</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luka 4:31-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Yesu na wahina wakwe nee waita mzi wa Kapelinaumu. Msi wekwezao wa Kuhumwiiza, Yesu akengia mwe Nyumba ya kukintania Wayahudi, nee avoka kuhinya wantu. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Wantu wose wekumtegeezaho nee wahondomaa kwa mahinyo yakwe, kwaviya khekuwa akahinya inga wahinyi wa miko, iya inga mntu mwenye udaho.<verse eid="MRK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Mwe Nyumba ya kukintania Wayahudi akaawiiya mntu yumwe mwekuwa na mazaiko, nee agutia, <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />“Una mbwai na swie, Yesu wa Nazaleti? Kweza kutidagamiza? Namanya wee u ndai? Wee ni Mntu Mtana wa Muungu!”<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Yesu akadiwakia ido zaiko, “Nyamaa muawe mntu uyu!”<verse eid="MRK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Dia zaiko dikamgea ugwa mtwi, akaiya kwa mgutio mkuu akamlawa. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Wantu wose wakahondomaa wakauzana, “Inu ivivihi? Uwo ni mahinyo mahya? Kwaviya kwa udaho mntu uyu alavya mazaiko, naho yamtegeeza!”<verse eid="MRK 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Nee mbui za Yesu zikaambazwa mwe si yose ya Galilaya.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awahonya wantu wangi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Matayo 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luka 4:38-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Wakalawa he Nyumba ya kukintania Wayahudi, wakaita mwenga kwa mwenga kaya kwa Simoni na Anduleya na Yakobo na Yohana wakaita hamwe nawo. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Naho mkwewe da Simoni ya kivyee nee yumwe usazi ni mtamu ana bombom kai, Yesu ekubuaho wakamwamba mbui zakwe. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Yesu akamtimia hehi yakwe, akamtoza mkono uyo mvyee, akamwenua na ahoaho homa ikamwekea. Akavoka kuwagosoeya ndima.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Guoni zua dekuswaho, wakamwegaiya Yesu watamu wose na wekukwewao mazaiko. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Wantu wose wa mzi uda wakakintana chongoi ya uvi. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Yesu akawahonya wantu wangi wekuwao na tamu mbaimbai na akaguusa mazaiko mangi. Naho khekuwaekea watamwiiye kintu chochose kwaviya wammanya yee ni ndai.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu abiikia mwe mzi wa Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luka 4:42-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Keokeo da mtungaihu, Yesu akalawa akaita hantu kwesaho wantu kuvika. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Simoni na weziwe wakaita kumoondeza, <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />wekumwonaho wakamwamba, “Kiya mntu akoondeza.”<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Yesu akawatambaisa, “Titeni he mizi mituhu yahehi nikabiikie uko, miye ncheza kwaajii iyo.”<verse eid="MRK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Naho akaita si yose ya Galilaya, akabiikia mwe Nyumba ya kukintania Wayahudi na kuwaakia mazaiko.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amhonya mntu mwenye utamu wa nyoka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Matayo 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luka 5:12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Mntu yumwe mwekuwa na utamu wa nyoka akambasa Yesu, akamheembeza na kumkintia mavindi na kumwamba, “Ukakunda, wadaha kuning'aza.”<verse eid="MRK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Yesu akamwonea mbazi, akenua mkono wakwe na kumdonta. Nee amwamba, “Nakunda, ng'azika! <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Ahoaho utamu wa nyoka ukamuekea yuda mntu, akang'azika.” <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Naho Yesu akamwamba aite kinyionyio na kumwamba, <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />“Tegeeza, usekumwamba mntu yoyose mbui inu. Akini hita ukeonyeshe kwa mviki, na kwaajii ya kung'aa kwako ukalavye mviko inga ekugombekavyo Musa koonyesha kuhona.”<verse eid="MRK 1:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Akini yuda mntu akaita na akavoka kuambaza mbui izo kiya hantu, hata Yesu khekudaha kwengia mwe mzi wowose kwa kweonyesha. Nee ekaa chongoi kwesaho wantu, nee ivyo wantu wakambasa kulawa kiya phande.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Yesu amhonya mntu mwekuohoa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Matayo 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka 5:17-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Yekwembokaho misi micheche, Yesu akauya mwe mzi wa Kapelinaumu wantu wakategeeza yukaya. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Aho wakeza wantu wangi na kumema hewazo adi kwe uvi. Yesu nee awabiikia mbui zakwe, <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />kisingi ichoicho wantu wane nee wabua wakamwenua mntu yumwe mwekuhooa, wakamwegaa kwa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Kwaajii ya zumwezumwe da wantu dekumemado, khawekudaha kubua hehi na Yesu. Ivyo wakabovoa hantu ha chusi yekuwayo uwanga ya hantu ekuwaho Yesu, nee waseeza javi da yuda mwekuhooa. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Yesu ekuonaho kuzumiiya kwao, akamwamba yuda mwekuhooa, “Mwanangu, kuekewa mavigaviga yako.”<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Wahinyi watuhu wa miko newawa mwe nyumba ida wekaa, wakamamakhanya mwe mioyo yao, <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Haikuka mbwahi ata agombeka ivi? Kamdumua Muungu! Khahana mdaha kuekea mntu mavigaviga iya Muungu ikedu!”<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Yesu akamanya wamamakhanyavyo mwe mioyo yao nee awauza, “Kwa mbwai mwamamakhanya ivyo mwe mioyo yenu? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Vyedi ni vihi, kumwamba mntu mwekuhooa, ‘Kuekewa mavigaviga yako’, hambu kugombeka, ‘Enuka wetwike javi dako wende?’ <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Akini mmanye Mwana wa Mntu ana udaho wa kuekea wantu mavigaviga yao mwe inusi.” Nee Yesu amwamba yuda mntu mwekuhooa, <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />“Nakwamba, gooka, wetwike javi dako uite kaya!”<verse eid="MRK 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Ahoaho wantu wose nee wamkauwa yuda mntu akenuka, na kudoa kilago chakwe, akahauka. Wantu wose nee wahondomaa na kumtogoa Muungu wakamba, “Khatizati kuona katu mbui inga inu!”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amwetanga Lawi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matayo 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka 5:27-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Yesu akaita vituhu khandakhanda ya tondoo da mazi ya Galilaya. Zumwezumwe da wantu dikambasa, nee avoka kuwahinya. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Ekuwaho akemboka, nee amwona Lawi mwana wa Alifayo, kekaa mwe kazumba ka kuihia kodi. Yesu akamwamba, “Nitongea.” Lawi akagooka akamtongea.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Kisingi kwemboka Yesu nee kekaa mwe nyumba ya Lawi, akada khande. Watoza ushuu na wada wagosoao mavigaviga nee wakambasa Yesu, na wangi wao wawa wekaa hamwe na wahina wakwe. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Wamwe wa wahinyi wa miko, wekuwao Mafalisayo, wekumuonaho Yesu ada hamwe na wagosoa mavigaviga na watoza ushuu, nee wawauza wahina wakwe, “Kwambwai ada na watoza ushuu na wagosoa mavigaviga?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Yesu ekuwategeezaho, nee agombeka, “Wantu wesao kuhuma khawakunda mganga akini wamkundao ni wada wahumao. Nchekweza kuwetanga wedi, iya wenye mavigaviga.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbui ya kwehiniza kuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matayo 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka 5:33-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Kisingi kimwe wahina wa Yohana mbatiiza hamwe na wahina wa Mafalisayo nee wehiniza kuda. Naho wantu wakeza wakamuuza Yesu, “Kwambwai wahina wa Yohana na wa Mafalisayo wehiniza kuda, akini wahina wako khawehiniza kuda?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Yesu akatambaisa, “Wantu wekugonekwao kwe wiya wadaha viivihi kwehiniza kuda ikawa zumbe wa wiya yu hamwe nao? Khawadaha kwehiniza kuda wakawa hamwe na zumbe wa wiya. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Akini kisingi chendakibue zumbe wa wiya endaho ausigwe gatigati yao, aho wendawehinize kuda.<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />“Khahana mntu msenga kilaka kihya na kukibwikabwika mwe nguo yekusakaayo, inga akatenda ivyo iko kilaka kihya chendakitatue nguo yekusakaayo, naho yendaibanike muno. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Naho khahana wantu wageayo divai mhya mwe mikwiji ya babu yekusakaayo, inga wakagosoa ivyo divai yendaitatue mikwiji ya babu, na divai hamwe na mikwiji ya babu yendaibanike. Divai mhya yagewa mwe mikwiji mihya.”<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahinya mbui ya Msi wa Kuhumwiiza</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matayo 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka 6:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Msi umwe wa Kuhumwiiza, Yesu na wahina wakwe wekuwaho wemboka mwe minda ya uhemba, wekuwaho wakenda wahina wakwe wakavoka kusenga uhemba. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Mafalisayo wakamuuza Yesu, “Kauwa, ni viivihi wagosoa mbui ziemewazo kugosoa Msi wa Kuhumwiiza?”<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Yesu nee awatambaisa, “Khamzati kusoma ekugosoavyo Daudi hamwe na weziwe kisingi wekuwaho na saa? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Yee akengia mwe Nyumba ya Muungu akada yada mabumunda yekuikwayo hemeso ya Muungu. Mbui inu igosoka kisingi cha Abiazali, nekawa Mviki Mkuu. Na ni waviki wowodu wakukundigwao wade mabumunda ayo, akini Daudi kada na kuwekha na weziwe.”<verse eid="MRK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Naho Yesu akawamba, “Msi wa Kuhumwiiza uikwa kwaajii ya wantu na khio wantu kwaajii ya Msi wa Kuhumwiiza. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Ivyo Mwana wa Mntu ana udaho ata wa Msi wa Kuhumwiiza.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesu amhonya mntu mwenye mkono wekuhooao</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matayo 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka 6:6-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Naho Yesu akengia vituhu mwe Nyumba ya kuvikia Wayahudi, nemuwa na mntu mwekuhooa mkono. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Umo wantu watuhu wakamgoja amhonye mntu uyo Msi wa Kuhumwiiza ili wadahe kumuahiya masa. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Yesu akamwamba uyo mntu mwekuhooa mkono, “Soo aha gooka hemeso ya kia yumwe.” <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Naho akawauza, “Kulawana na miko yetu takundigwa kugosoa mbwai Msi wa Kuhumwiiza? Kuohoa ugima au kukoma?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 3:4">Akini wowo khawekuandua dodose! <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Aho Yesu akawafuiya meso kwa maya, akaugumia, kwaajii ya mioyo yao itogayo. Naho amwamba yuda mntu, “Enua mkono wako!” Naye akenua mkono wakwe, ukatenda mgima vituhu. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Ahoaho Mafalisayo wakalawa chongoi, wakakintana hamwe na kizumwezumwe cha Helode wakaondeza sia ihi wendayo wamkome Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zumwezumwe da wantu khandakhanda ya tondoo da mazi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Yesu hamwe na wahina wakwe, wakahauka na kuita khandakhanda ya tondoo da mazi. Na zumwezumwe da wantu kulawa si ya Galilaya dikambasa, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />wekusikiaho mbui zose ekugosoazo, zumwezumwe da wantu dikamwezea kulawa Uyahudi na Yelusalemu na Idumea na si zose zekuwazo awio da zua da zigizigi da mazi Yolodani hamwe na wada wa hehi wa si ya Tilo na Sidoni. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Yesu akawamba wahina wakwe wamuikie ngaawa kwaviya wantu wasekumfintafinta. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Kwaviya ne kawahonya watamu wangi, na watamu wose ne wamfintafinta wadahe kumdonta. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Na kia mwenye zaiko ekumuonaho Yesu, aketambika ahosi hemeso yakwe na kugombeka, “Wee ni Mwana wa Muungu.”<verse eid="MRK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Akini Yesu akayaemeza kwa ukai yada mazaiko yasekuwamba wantu kuwa yee ni ndai.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asagua waagiiwa kumi dimwe na waidi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matayo 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka 6:12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Yesu ne akwea kwe kiima akawetanga wada ekuwakundao ne wambasa. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Naho ne awasagua wantu kumi dimwe na waidi na akawetanga waagiiwa, wekae naye awaagiiye kubiikia wantu, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />na wawe na udaho wa kulavya mazaiko.<verse eid="MRK 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Aho kumi dimwe na waidi wekusagulwao ni awa, Simoni mwekwekhigwa zina da Petulo, <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Yakobo na kakie Yohana wana wa Zebedayo, Yesu akawekha zina Boanege mana yakwe, “Wantu wa tuntumo.” <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Andulea na Filipo na Batolomayo na Matayo na Tomasi na Yakobo mwana wa Alifayo na Tadayo na Simoni mtoanaji wa si yakwe. <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />Yuda Isikaliyote mwekumhituka Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Belizebuli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Matayo 12:22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luka 11:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12:10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Naho Yesu akauya kaya na zumwezumwe da wantu dikakintana vituhu, ata Yesu na wahina wakwe khawekupata phasi ya kuda khande. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Nduguze wekusikiaho mbui iyo wakenda kumdoa kwaajii wantu ne wamba, “Ana kiau.”<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Wamwe wa Wahinyi wa Miko kulawa Yelusalemu wakamba, Kakwewa Belizebuli! Mkuu wa mazaiko awalavya wantu mazaiko kwa udaho wa mkuu wa mazaiko.<verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Yesu akawetanga, akagombeka nao kwa simo, “Ibiisi adaha viivihi kumguusa Ibiisi mweziwe?” <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Inga wantu wa useuta umwe wakatoana khondo wenye kwa wenye, useuta wendaugwe. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Wantu wa kaya mwenga wakesekwevana kaya iyo yendaidagamie. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Kwaivyo useuta wa Ibiisi ukepanga vizumwezumwe khaudaha kwekaisa iya wendaudagamie.<verse eid="MRK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />“Khahana mntu adahae kwengia mwe nyumba ya mntu mwenye mdundugo na kuvidoa vintu vyakwe, avoke kutoana na kumzengeteza yuda mntu mwenye mdundugo nae akamvota endaadahe kuvidoa vintu vyakwe.”<verse eid="MRK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />“Kwei nawamba, wantu wadaha kuekewa mavigaviga yao hamwe na kumbea Muungu.” <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Akini mntu agombekaye yesayokutama kwa Muye wa Muungu khana aekewe katu, endaawe na mavigaviga ya kae na kae. <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Yesu kagombeka ivyo kwaajii wantu watuhu ne wamba, “Ana mazaiko.”<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mami yakwe da Yesu na wanduguze</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matayo 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka 8:19-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Mami yakwe da Yesu na wanduguze wakabua aho, wakagooka chongoi wakamwagiiya mntu kumwetanga Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Zumwezumwe da wantu diwa dekaa aho wekaa bunga. Naho wantu wakamwamba, “Kauwa mami yako na wanduguzo wauko chongoi, wakwetanga.”<verse eid="MRK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Yesu akawatambaisa, “Mmaa na wandugu zangu ni wakina ndai?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Aho akawakauwa wada wantu wekuwao wekaa bunga akamba, “Awa ne mmaa yangu na wandugu zangu! <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Mntu yoyose agosoaye akundavyo Muungu, uyo ne kaka yangu na umbu dangu na mmaa yangu.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Msimo wa mntu mhanda mbeyu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Matayo 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luka 8:4-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Yesu ne avoka vituhu kuhinya khandakhanda ya tondoo da mazi ya Galilaya. Zumwezumwe da wantu wangi dikaika bunga naho akengia mwe ngaawa na kwekaa, wantu wose wekaa mwe sanga khandakhanda ya tondoo da mazi. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Akawahinya mbui nyingi kwa simo, na mwe mahinyo yakwe akawamba.<verse eid="MRK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Tegeezani! Mntu mhanda mbeyu kenda kwetia mbeyu.” <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Ekuaho aketia mbeyu ntuhu zigwa khandakhanda ya sia ne wadege weza wakazida. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Ntuhu zikagwa mwe iwe kwesiho na sanga, zikahota aho, kwaviya sanga nee ncheche. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Zua dekulawaho mbeyu ziya zikanyaa, kwaviya mazindo yakwe khayokuwa na udaho. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Mbeyu ntuhu nezagwa mwe miwa, ida miwa neyakua na kuzifintafinta ziya mbeyu naho khazokuvyaa. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Na mbeyu ntuhu zikagwa mwe sanga ntana, ne zakua na kuvyaa vitana, mwenga makumi matatu na mwenga makumi mtandatu, na mwenga makumi kumi.<verse eid="MRK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Yesu akagombeka, “Mwenye magutwi na ategeeze.”<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu agombeka mana ya simo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Matayo 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luka 8:9-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Yesu ekuwaho ikedu wamwe wa wada wekumtegeezao hamwe na wahina wakwe kumi dimwe na waidi ne wambasa na kumuuza kia ekutamwiacho kwa simo. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Yesu akawatambaisa, “Nywie mwekhigwa kumanya sii zose za Useuta wa Muungu, akini kwa wada weuko chongoi wenda wembigwe kia kintu kwa simo, <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />ili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">‘Wakaue kwei, akini wasekuona</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">Wategeeze kwei, akini wasekumanya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">Ama khivyo ne wamhitukia Muungu, wakaekewa.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asosoa msimo wa mhanda mbeyu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Matayo 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luka 8:11-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Naho Yesu akawauza, “Nyie khammanya msimo unu? Mwadaha viivihi kumanya simo tuhu?” <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Mbeyu ihandwayo na mntu ahandae mbeyu ni mbui ya Muungu. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Wantu watuhu ni inga viya mbeyu zekwetiwazo siai. Ahoaho wategeezaho ida mbui ya Muungu, Ibiisi eza na kuiusa mwe mioyo yao. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Wantu watuhu nao ni inga mbeyu zekwetiwazo mwe maiwe. Ahoaho wategeezaho mbui ida wakaihokea kwa kinyemi. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Akini khaviwengia nakuwa na mazindo mwe mioyo yao. Mbui ida yekaa kwa misi micheche na kisingi cha suuba kikalawiiya, ahoaho mntu uyu hufa maya. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Wantu watuhu inga mbeyu zekugwazo he miwa. Uwo ni msimo wa wada wekutegezao ida mbui, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />akini maatu ya mwe inusi na utiizi wa mai, na kukunda muno vintu vingi zikawengia mwe mioyo yao, zafintafinta ida mbui ya Muungu na kuvota kuvyaa matunda. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Akini watuhu inga mbeyu zekwetiwazo he sanga ntana. Aho wategeeza ida mbui ya Muungu, wakaihokea na kuvyaa matunda watuhu makumi matatu, watuhu makumi mtandatu na watuhu makumi kumi.<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Koloboi yekugubikwayo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luka 8:16-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Yesu akaendeea kuwamba, “Uwo wantu wadaha kuwasha koloboi na kwengiza nyumbani na kuigubika kwa biga au kuika mzungui? Aah! Waiika uwanga ya kiango. <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Naho kintu chochose chekufiswacho chenda kioneke, na chochose chekugubikwacho chenda kigubulwe. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Mwenye magutwi ya kutegeeza na ategeeze!”<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Naho akamba, “Tegeezani vitana kwa kia mtegeezacho! Miko idaida mtumiayo kuamuiiya watuhu, Muungu enda azitumie kuamuiiya nywie, nayo ata kai muno. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Kwaviya mwena endaamemezewe, na mwesena endaahokwe kiya kidodo enacho.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Msimo wa mbeyu ihotayo na kukua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Yesu akaendeea kugombeka, “Useuta wa Muungu inga yezayo mntu ahanda mbeyu mwe mnda. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Kio agona, musi yu meso na kisingi icho mbeyu yahota na kukua yee mwenye khamanya vyekugosokavyo. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Kwaviya sanga yenye yagosoa mimea kukua na kuvyaa, uvoka kulavya zani teke, naho dakua suke na kulawiiya uhemba wekudahayo. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Uhemba ukabinda kudahaa, mntu uyo adoa nyengo na kuvoka kusenga, kwaajii kisingi cha ubosi kibua.” <figure style="fig" file="12 Sickle.jpg" size="col" ref="4:29">Mntu asenga uhemba kwa kutumia nyengo</figure><verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Msimo wa mbeyu ya haladani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Matayo 13:31-32</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luka 13:18-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Naho Yesu akagombeka, “Tiuiganye na mbwai Useuta wa Muungu? Tiutamwiize kwa simo zihi? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Waigana na mbeyu ya haladani, ambayo ni ndodo kwesima zose zihandwazo mwe inusi. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Akini ikabinda kuhandwa, yahota na kutenda ziti kuu kwesima yose mwe mnda. Naho matambi yakwe yawa makuu hata wadege wa uwanga wazenga masasa yao mwe matambi yakwe.”<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Yesu akawabiikia mbui zakwe kwa simo tuhu nyingi inga izo, akatamwiiana nao kadii wekudahavyo kumanya. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Khekutamwiiya nao chochose iya kwa simo, akini ekuaho hamwe na wahina wakwe ikedu akawamba kia kintu.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atuiza khusi khai</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Matayo 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka 8:22-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Msi udauda, guoni Yesu akagombeka na wahina wakwe, “Titeni phande ntuhu ya tondoo da mazi.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Aho wakabada dia zumwezumwe da wantu, wahina wakwe wakengia mwe ngaawa ekuwayo Yesu. Viyaviya ngaawa ntuhu zikambasa. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Khusi khai ikaawiya, mkubwaniso wa mazi ikatoa ida ngaawa, nayo ikavoka kumema mazi.<figure style="fig" file="09 Boat in Storm.jpg" size="col" ref="4:37">Mkubwaniso wa mazi waitoa ngaawa</figure> <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Yesu ne yunyuma ya ngaawa, naho kagonea mwe kigonea, wahina wakwe wakamwenua na kumwamba, “Mhinyi kwa mbwai khutipatiiza khuona inga tinda tiuye na nyuma?”<verse eid="MRK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Yesu akenuka na kuiwakia ida khusi na kuyamba mawimbi, “Nyamaa! Twiiya!” Ahoaho khusi ikaeka, ne kwatwiiya tui. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Yesu akawauza wahina wakwe, “Kwa mbwai mwaogoha? Khamzati kuzumiiya du?”<verse eid="MRK 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Naho wakaogoha muno, wakauzana wenye, “Uyu nndai? Hadi khusi na mawimbi vyamtegeeza!”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu amhonya mntu mwenye mazaiko</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matayo 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka 8:26-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Yesu na wahina wakwe wakabua phande ya kaidi ya tondoo da mazi ya Galilaya mwe si ya Wagelasi. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Ahoaho Yesu ekuseeaho mwe ngaawa akakintana na mntu yumwe mwenye mazaiko kaawiiya he mambia. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Mntu yuda ne akekaa kwe mambia na khahana mntu mwekudaha kumtoza na kumzengeteza minyololo. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Maa nyingi wamzengeteza kwa phingu mwe mikono na minyololo mwe miundi, akini kia maa akadaha kuidumua iyo minyololo na izo phingu, naho khahana mntu mwekudaha kumuemeza. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Msi na kio ne akekaa mwe mambia na kwe miima akagutia na kwesengasenga na maiwe.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Ekumuonaho Yesu kwa hae, akamguukia, akamwenamia. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Akamba kwa mgutio mkuu, “Una mbwai nami?, Yesu Mwana wa Muungu mwe uko uwanga muno! Nakuhembeza kwa zina da Muungu wesekunisuumiza!” <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Akagombeka ivyo kwaviya Yesu nekawa kamwamba, “Ee zaiko mlaweni mntu uyu!”<verse eid="MRK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Aho, Yesu akamuuza, “Zina dako ni ndai?” Ne amtambaisa, “Zina dangu ni hindoo kwaviya ti wangi.” <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Naho akamhembeeza Yesu asekuwaguusa mwe si ida.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Hehi na aho ne kuwa na tintimo kuu da nguuwe uisi he mpoomoko wa muima. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Aho mazaiko yada yakamhembeza Yesu na kumwamba, “Tegae tikengie kwa wada nguuwe.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Naye akayekha uhusa, aho yada mazaiko yakamlawa mntu yuda, yakawengiia wada nguuwe. Tintimo dose ido da nguuwe ne diwa elufu mbii dikaseeya mwe uda mpoomoko mkai dikengia mwe tondoo da mazi.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Waisi wa wada nguuwe, ne waguuka na kuambaza mbui ida mwe mizi na mwe minda. Wantu wakaita wakauwe yekulawiayo. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Ne wamtimia Yesu, wakammbuiya mntu yudayuda mwekuwa kakwewa na hindoo da mazaiko kekaa asi, kavaa nguo, na akii zakwe zimuuiya, wantu wose wakaogoha. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Na wada wekuonaho mbui ida ne wawamba wantu watuhu, chekulawiacho kwa yuda mntu mwekuwa na mazaiko hamwe na mbui za wada nguuwe.<verse eid="MRK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Aho, wantu wakamhembeza Yesu alawe mwe si yao.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Yesu ekuwaho akwea mwe ngaawa yuda mntu mwekuwa na mazaiko akamhembeza waite wose.<verse eid="MRK 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Akini Yesu akamweemeza, naho akamwamba, “Hita kwenu kaya kwa wanduguzo ukagombeke yada yose Zumbe ekukugosoeavyo na kukufiia mbazi.”<verse eid="MRK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Aho yuda mntu akaita na kuvoka kubiikia Dekapoli mana yakwe ni si ya mizi kumi dimwe, mbui zose Yesu ekumgosoeavyo. Wantu wose wakahondomaa.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awahonya mwana Yailo na mvyee yumwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matayo 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka 8:40-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Yesu akaita vituhu phande ya kaidi ya tondoo da mazi kwa ngaawa. Zumwezumwe da wantu dikammemea hemeso yakwe, naye ne kagooka khandakhanda ya tondoo da mazi. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Aho akeza mntu yumwe etangwa Yailo yumwe wa wakuu wa Nyumba ya kuvikia Wayahudi, ekumuonaho Yesu akakinta mavindi hemeso yakwe. <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />Akamhembeeza akamba, “Mwanangu wa kivyee mdodo ni mtamu yu hehi na kuuya na nyuma. Nakuhembeza tite ukamuikie mikono yako adahe kuhona na aendeee kwekaa.”<verse eid="MRK 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Aho, Yesu akahauka hamwe naye. Wantu wangi wakamtongea Yesu na kumfintafinta kia phande.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Aho ne hawa na mvyee yumwe mwekuwa na utamu wa mtuo kwa kisingi cha myaka kumi dimwe na miidi. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Mvyee uyo ne kaangadika muno kuita kwa waganga wangi. Na etiho kaza mai zakwe zose, akini khekuona ebae, iya kaendeea kuwa mtamu muno. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Naye uyo mvyee ne kasikia mbui za Yesu ne ahenya gatigati ya dia zumwezumwe da wantu. Akamlawiiya Yesu kwa nyuma na kudonta nguo yakwe. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Kwaviya ne kegombekea mwe moyo wakwe, “Nikadonta nguo yakwe, nenda nihone.”<verse eid="MRK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Ahoaho utamu wa mtuo ukanyaa, akeona mwe mwii wakwe kahona utamu wakwe. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Ahoaho, Yesu akamanya udaho umlawa. Neahitukia dia zumwezumwe da wantu na kuwauza, “Nndai mwekudonta nguo yangu?”<verse eid="MRK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Wahina wakwe wakamtambaisa, “Woona wantu wakufintafinta, naho wauza ni ndai mwekukudonta?”<verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Akini Yesu akakauwa phande zose amwone nndai mwekumdonta. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Aho yuda mvyee akamanya yekumlawiayo, akeaviiza, akakama kwa kuogoha, aketambika asi hemeso ya Yesu, na kugombeka yose yekumlawiayo. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Yesu akamwamba, “Mwanangu kuzumiiya kwako kukuhonya, hita kwa utuivu naho utende mgima.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Yesu ekuwaaho agombeka, ne weza wantu kulawa kwa Yailo mkuu wa Nyumba ya kuvikia Wayahudi, wakamwamba, “Mwanao kauya na nyuma kae, kwambwai wampisha mhinyi?” <verse eid="MRK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Akini, Yesu khekuwaanduwa wekugombekacho nee amwamba yuda mkuu wa Nyumba ya kuvikia Wayahudi, “Usekuogoha, wee zumiiya du.” <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Yesu khekukunda mntu yoyose amtongee, iya Petulo na Yakobo na Yohana nduguye Yakobo. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Wekubuaho mwe nyumba ya Yailo, Yesu ne aona wantu waketambikatambika asi wakiiya na kutoa bwaimbo. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Yesu ne engia gati, na kugombeka, “Kwa mbwai mwetambikatambika na kuiiya? Mndee khekuuya na nyuma, kagona.”<verse eid="MRK 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Akini wowo wakamseka. Aho akawalavya wose chongoi, akamdoa tati yakwe na mami yakwe da yuda mwana na wahina wakwe watatu, wakengia mwe chumba wekumwikacho yuda mndee. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Naho akamtoza mkono, na kumwamba, “Talita, komu,” Mana yakwe “Mndee mdodo nakwamba enuka!”<verse eid="MRK 5:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Ahoaho mndee yuda akagooka, na kuvoka kuita. Mndee yuda ne kawa na myaka kumi dimwe na miidi. Aho wantu wakahondomaa muno kwa dekulawiado. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Akini Yesu akawaemeza wasekugombeka kwa mntu yoyose ida mbui. Naho akawamba wamwekhe khande yuda mndee.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesu aemewa uko Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Matayo 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka 4:16-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Yesu akalawa hada, akaita mwe mzi wakwe na wahina wakwe ne wamtongea. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Msi wa Kuhumwiiza wekubuaho, akavoka kuhinya mwe Nyumba ya kuvikia Wayahudi. Wantu wangi wekumtegeezao wakahondomaa wakauza, “Uwo mbui izi kazilavia kuhi? Ni udaho uhi ekwekhigwao? Naho agosoa viivihi tangio izi? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Uwo uyu khii yuda seemaa, mwana Maliamu, wanduguze ni Yakobo na Yusufu na Yuda na Simoni? Na maumbuze wekaa ahaaha hetu?” Wantu ne wawa na matumatu nae.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Yesu akawamba, “Muoni wa Muungu akundwa kia hantu iya mwe si yakwe na kwa wanduguze na kaya kwakwe khakundwa.”<verse eid="MRK 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Khekugosoa tangio zozose hada, iya akaika mikono kwa watamu wacheche, ne awahonya. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Yesu akahondomaa muno, kwaviya wantu khawokuzumiia.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 6:6">Yesu awagiiya wahina kumi dimwe na waidi</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Matayo 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka 9:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Naho Yesu neaita mizi ya hehi, akahinya wantu. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Akawetanga wada wahina kumi dimwe na waidi, akavoka kuwaagiia waidiwaidi. Ne awekha udaho wa kuguusa mazaiko. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Akagombeka, “Msekudoa kintu chochose mwe ntambo yenu iya ngoda du. Msekudoa khande, mkwiji wala hea. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Vaani sabana, akini mwesekudoa gwanda tuhu.” <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Vituhu akawamba, “Kaya yoyose mwendayo mhokewe ekaani umo na msekusamasama kuita kaya tuhu hadi mwendaho mhauke mwe mzi uwo. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Hantu hohose wantu wendawo wawaemee kuwahokea au kuwategeeza, haukeni aho na kung'unteni sanga ya mwe miundi yenu inga hinyo kwao.”<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Awo wakahauka na kuwabiikia wantu wamhitukie Muungu. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Wakaguusa mazaiko mangi na kuwasisa mavuta ya mizaituni watamu wangi na kuwahonya.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ufe wa Yohana mbatiiza</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Matayo 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka 9:7-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Naho, Seuta Helode ekutegeezaho mbui izi kwaviya togoo za Yesu ne ziambazwa kia hantu. Wantu watuhu ne wakagombeka, “Yohana mbatiiza kayuyuka kulawa mwe wekufao, ne mana udaho wa kugosoa vihii wagosoa ndima.”<verse eid="MRK 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Wantu watuhu wakagombeka, “Uyu ni Eliya” Na wantu watuhu ne wagombeka, “Uyu ni Muoni wa Muungu inga yumwe wa Waoni wa Muungu wa kae.”<verse eid="MRK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Akini Helode ekusikiaho akagombeka, “Uyu ni Yohana mbatiiza! Nekumsengae mtwi, tambe kayuyuka!” <verse eid="MRK 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Aho bosi Helode mwenye kakunda Yohana Mbatiiza agwiwe na aikwe mwe kifungo. Helode katenda ivyo kwaajii ya Helodia, mvyee uyo ne nimkaza Filipo, nduguye Helode. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Kwaviya Yohana ne kamwamba Helode, “Khio vitana kumdoa mkaza nduguyo.”<verse eid="MRK 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Aho Helodiya akakimwa muno na Yohana na akakunda kumkoma, akini khekudaha kumkoma. <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Helode ne akamuogoha Yohana kwaviya kamanya Yohana ni mntu mtana na yedi, ivyo akamkindia asekukomwa. Helode kakundisa kumtegeeza Yohana, akini ekumtegezaho, akahungumia muno mwe moyo wakwe.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Msi umwe Helodia akapata phasi kisingi cha sikukhuu ya khumbuso da kuvyaigwa kwakwe Helode. Helode kawagosoeya ntafuno wadaa waongoezi na wakuu wa mahindoo hamwe na wagookezi wose wa Galilaya. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Aho mwana kivyee wa Helodiya akengia akavina, akawatamiza muno Helode na wageni wakwe. Seuta Helode akamwamba yuda mndee, “Niombeza dodose ukundado, nami nenda nikwekhe.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Naho akamwahiiya, “Chochose wendacho uniombeze, nenda nikwekhe hata ntii ya useuta wangu.”<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Aho uyo mndee akalawa kumuuza mami yakwe, “Niombeze mbwai?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">Mmaa yakwe akamtambaisa, “Ombeza mtwi wa Yohana Mbatiiza.”<verse eid="MRK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Yuda mndee akamuuiya seuta kinyionyio na kumwombeza, “Nakunda unekhe isasa mtwi wa Yohana Mbatiiza mwe chano.”<verse eid="MRK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Seuta akoona usungu, akini kwaviya ya kuaha kwakwe na kwaviya ya wageni wose wekuwao mwe ntafuno, khekudaha kumuemeea. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Aho seuta akamwagiiya asikai kueta mtwi wa Yohana Mbatiiza. Asikai akaita akamdumua mtwi Yohana Mbatiiza. <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />Yuda asikali akaueta mtwi mwe chano, akamwekha yuda mndee, na mndee naye akamwekha mami yakwe. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Wahina wa Yohana Mbatiiza wekusikiaho mbui ida, ne waita wakaudoa mwii wakwe wakaugea mwe mbia.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awekha khande wantu elufu shano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matayo 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohana 6:1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Wada waagiiwa wakauya wakakintana hemeso ya Yesu na kumwamba yose wekugosoayo na kuhinya. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Yesu akawamba, “Titeni swie ikedu kwesiho wantu mkahumwiize” kagombeka ivyo kwaviya ne hana wantu wangi, wekuwao wabua aho na kuhauka hata Yesu na wahina wakwe khawokudaha kuwa na phasi ya kuda khande. <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Aho wakahauka wowodu kwa ngaawa na kuita kwesiho wantu.<verse eid="MRK 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Akini wantu wangi wakawaoona wakaita naho wakawamanya. Ne wantu kulawa kia mzi wakaguuka na kuongoa kubua ekuako aita Yesu na wahina wakwe. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Yesu ekuseeaho mwe ngaawa, ne aona zumwezumwe da wantu, akawafiia mbazi, kwaviya ne wawa inga ngoto wesao kuwa na muiisi. Akavoka kuwahinya mbui nyingi na nyingi. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Wahina wakwe wakambasa Yesu wakamwamba, “Hantu aha nihe kiwawe na zua daswa. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Wabade wantu awa waite mwe minda na mwe mizi ya hehi, wakague khande.”<verse eid="MRK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Akini Yesu akawatambaisa, “Wekheni nywie khande.” Ne wamuuza, “Khuona inga tendatikundigwe tiwe na mshahaa wa mntu wa miongo minane idahe kugua mabumunda na kuwekha wantu wade?”<verse eid="MRK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Yesu akawauza, “Mna mabumunda mangahi? Hitani mkakauwe.” Wekumanyaho, wakamwamba, “Kuna mabumunda mashano na samaki waidi.”<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Aho Yesu akagombeka na wahina wakwe wawaike wantu vizumwezumwe na kwekaa asi he mani. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Ne wekaa mwe vizumwezumwe vya wantu makumi kumi na vizumwezumwe vya makumi mashano. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Naho Yesu akadoa yada mabumunda mashano na wada samaki waidi, akakauwa uwanga kwa Muungu, akavijaiya, ne abendua yada mabumunda na kuwekha wahina wakwe wawapangie wantu. Na wada samaki waidi wawapangie wose. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Wantu wose ne wada na kweguta. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Wahina wakwe wakadodoa phugutio za vyekusigaavyo vya mabumunda na samaki wakamemeeza ngahu kumi dimwe na mbii. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Wekudao ida mikate ne wawa wagosi elufu shano.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu enda uwanga ya mazi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Matayo 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yohana 6:15-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Ahoaho Yesu akawamba wahina wakwe wakwee mwe ngaawa wamuongoee kuita Betisaida, phande ya kaidi ya tondoo da mazi, kisingi yee aaga zumwezumwe da wantu. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Ekubindaho kuagana nao, ne aita mwe muima kuvika Muungu. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Yekubuaho guoni, ngaawa ne igatigati ya tondoo da mazi, akini Yesu ne awa ikedu mwe sanga khavu. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Aho akoona wahina wakwe mwe ngaawa wakepisha kwa kutoa makasia, kwaviya ne wakahigana na khusi. Hehi na kucha, Yesu akawabasa wahina uku enda uwanga ya mazi, akakunda kuwemboka.<verse eid="MRK 6:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Akini wekumuonaho akenda uwanga ya mazi, ne wammamakhanya ni mzimu, wakakema. <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />Kwaviya wose wekumuonaho ne waogoha muno. Ahoaho Yesu akagombeka nao, “Twiiyani msekuogoha! Ni mie!” <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Naho akengia mwe ngaawa wekuwamo na khusi ikatwiiya, wahina wakwe ne wahondomaa muno. <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />Kwaviya ne khawazati kumanya mana ya yada mabumunda wekudao wantu elufu shano.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awahonya watamu uko mwe si ya Genesaleti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Matayo 14:34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Wakemboka phande ya kaidi ya tondoo da mazi wakabua mwe si ya Genezaleti, aho ne wagea kigomogomo. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Wekulawaho mwe ngaawa, wantu naho wakammanya Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Naho wakaita kinyionyio mwe si yose, wakawenua watamu mwe vilago vyao ne wamwegaiya Yesu, hohose hada wekutegeezaho yuaho. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Kia hantu Yesu ekubuaho, mwe mizi na mwe minda, wantu ne wawaika watamu wao wazoi, Wakamhembeeza wadon'te du msao wa nguo yakwe, na wose wekumdontao nee wahona.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">Mahinyo ya mababa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Matayo 15:1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Wamwe wa Mafalisayo na Wahinyi wa Miko wekuwao walawa Yelusalemu ne wakintana hemeso ya Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Wakoona wamwe wa wahina wa Yesu wada khande kwa mikono yao kwesiho kusunta inga ikundingwavyo na Miko ya Wayahudi.<verse eid="MRK 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Mafalisayo na Wayahudi wose watozeeza mahinyo wekuyahokeayo kwa wadaa wao, khawada khande yoyose hadi wasunte mikono yao vitana kubua mwe kiko. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Naho khawada chochose kulawa gwiiyo hadi wasunte mikono. Viyaviya watozeeza mahinyo matuhu wekuhokeayo kuvokea kae, inga viya wasuntavyo vikombe na nyungu na via vya shaba.<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Aho wada Mafalisayo na Wahinyi wa Miko wakamuuza Yesu, “Kwa mbwai wahina wako khawatongea mahinyo ya wadaa? Iya wada khande kwesiho kusunta mikono?”<verse eid="MRK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Yesu akawatambaisa, “Muoni Isaya ne koona kwei kwenu nywie wabakha inga viya ekugondavyo, Muungu kagombeka, ‘Wantu awa wanitegeeza mwe miomo yao, iya mioyo yao ihae na mie. <verse eid="MRK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Naho wanivikia buwe, kwaviya mbui wazihinyazo ni miagiiyo ya kiuntudu wakigombeka ayo ni mahinyo ya Muungu!’<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />“Nyie mwabada Miko ya Muungu na kutongea miagiiyo ya wantu.”<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Yesu akatendesa kugombeka, “Nyie mwadaha kuiemea kwa unyanyi Miko ya Muungu kwaajii ya kutongea mahinyo yenu! <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Mana Musa kagombeka, ‘Wategeezeni tati zenu na mami zenu naho mntu yoyose amdumuae tati yakwe au mami yakwe yakundigwa akomwe.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Akini nywie mwahinya, inga mntu mwenacho kintu kidahacho kumwambiiza tati yakwe au mami yakwe, akini akamba kintu icho ni ‘Kolobani’ yani ni funge kwa Muungu. <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />Naho kheshuutiza vituhu kumwambiiza tati yakwe au mami yakwe. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Ivi ne mbeavyo mbui za Muungu, kwaajii ya mahinyo mhokezanayo. Naho mwagosoa mbui nyingi inga izi.”<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbui zimtendazo mntu asekukudigwa na Muungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Matayo 15:10-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Yesu ne awetanga vituhu zumwezumwe da wantu, akawamba, “Nitegeezani nyose, mmanye.” <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Khakuna kintu chengiacho kwa mntu kidahacho kumtenda asekukundigwa na Muungu, akini kilawacho ndani ya mntu nee kimtendacho mntu asekukudigwa na Muungu. <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Mwenye magutwi ya kutegeeza na ategeeze!<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Ekubadaho zumwezumwe da wantu na kwengia kaya, wahina wakwe wakamuuza mana ya msimo uwo. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Yesu akagombeka, “Hata nywie khamna umanyi? Khammanya kintu kimwengiacho mntu kulawa chongoi khakidaha kumtenda mntu asekukudigwa hemeso ya Muungu, <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />kwaviya khachekumwegia mwe moyo wakwe iya mwe ifu, naho chalawa chongoi mwe mwii.” Kwa kugombeka ivyo, Yesu kauusu khande zose ziigwe.<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Akatendesa kugombeka, “Kimlawacho mntu ndani yakwe ne kimtendacho asekukudigwa hemeso ya Muungu. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Kwaviya mwe moyo wa mntu kwalawa mbui zesazo kutama, na ukianga na ubavi na ukomaji, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />na kianga na choyo na ubanasi na utiizi na umeo wa mai na kinyuu na kubea na kibui na ubahau. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Mbui zose izo zalawa mwe moyo wa mntu na kumtenda asekukudigwa hemeso ya Muungu.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzumiiya kwa mvyee yumwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Matayo 15:21-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Yesu akahauka aho na kuita mwe si ya hehi na mzi wa Tilo. Uko akengia mwe kaya mwenga na khekukunda mntu yoyose ammanye, akini khekudaha kwefisa. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Aho mvyee yumwe kawa na mwanaye wa kindee mwekuwa na zaiko, ekutegezavyo mbui za Yesu akeza hada na aketambika asi hemeso ya Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Mvyee yuda khekuwa Myahudi, iya nee ni mwenyezi wa Silofoinike mwe si ya Siliya. Aho akamheembeza Yesu amlavye mazaiko yuda mwanawe. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Akini Yesu akamtambaisa, “Eka wana wegute, kwaviya khio vitana kudoa khande ya wana na kuwasia makui.”<verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Yuda mvyee ne amtambaisa, “Zumbe” ni vitana, “Akini hata makui nayo yeaho asi ya meza yadaha kudodoa phugutio za khande vyekusigazwavyo.”<verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Naho Yesu ne agombeka, “Kwaajii ya kutambaisa ivyo, hita kaya, naho wenda umbwiie mwanao zaiko dimlawa!”<verse eid="MRK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Aho yuda mvyee akauya kaya na kumbwiia mwanawe kagona mwe usazi na dia zaiko dimlawa kae.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amhonya mntu mwenye kisita kikai na kiziba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Yesu ne alawa mwe mihaka ya mzi wa Tilo akemboka gatigati ya Sidoni akaita Dekapoli mana yakwe si ya mizi kumi, kwembokea tondoo da mazi ya Galilaya. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Aho wakamwegaiiya mwenye kisita kikai na kiziba, wakamheembeza amuiikie mikono. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Yesu akamuusa mwe dia zumwezumwe da wantu, akamgea vyaa mwe magutwi ya yuda mntu, ne aswa ovu mwe vyaa vyakwe na kumdonta mwe ulimi wakwe. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Naho akakauwa uwanga, akatoa mhezemuko akamwamba, “Efata,” Mana yakwe, “Vuguka.”<verse eid="MRK 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Ahoaho magutwi yakwe yakavuguka na ulimi wakwe ukaegea na kuvoka kutamwiiya vitana. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Yesu ne awaemeza wantu wasekumwamba mntu yoyose mbui izo. Akini ekuwaemezavyo ne watendesaho kuziambaza mbui izo. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Wantu wose wakahondomaa muno, wakagombeka, “Kagosoa yose matana kawajaiya viziba kutegeeza na mabubu kudaha kugombeka!”<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu awekha khande wantu elufu nne</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Matayo 15:32-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Kisingi icho, zumwezumwe da wantu dikakintana vituhu, na khawekuwa na khande. Aho, Yesu akawetanga wahina wakwe akawamba, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“Nawafiiya mbazi wantu awa kwaviya wawa na mie kwa misi mitatu, naho khawana khande. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Nikawabada waite kaya kwesaho kuda wenda wagwe msae siai, kwaviya watuhu walawa hae.”<verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Wahina wakwe wakamuuza, “Hanu he kiwawe tendatikundigwe tipatie kuhi mabumunda ya kuwegusa wantu wose awa?”<verse eid="MRK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Yesu akawauza, “Mna mabumunda mangahi?” Wakamtambaisa, “Tina mabumunda mfungate.”<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Aho Yesu akawamba wantu wekae asi, akayadoa yada mabumunda mfungate, akamtogoa Muungu, akayabendua yada mabumunda, akawekha wahina wakwe wawapangie wantu, ne wawapangia. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Naho kuwa na samaki wacheche. Yesu akamtogoa Muungu, na kuwekha wahina wakwe wawapangie wantu viyaviya. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Wantu wose wakada, na kweguta. Ne wahina wakwe wakadodoa phugutio za khande za vyekusigaavyo na kumemeeza ngahu mfungate. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Naho wekudao khande wabua wantu elufu nne, Yesu akabadana nao. <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Ahoaho akakwea ngaawa hamwe na wahina wakwe na kuita mzi wa Dalumanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafalisayo wakunda tangio</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Matayo 12:38-42</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">16:1-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Wamwe wa Mafalisayo wakambasa Yesu na kuvoka kutambaisana nae. Wakamgeeza, wakakunda agosee tangio koonesha kuwa udaho wakwe walawa uwanga kwa Muungu. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Akini Yesu akoona usungu mwe moyo wakwe akagombeka, “Ni kwambwai wantu wa uvyazi unu wakunda tangio? Kwei nawamba khahana tangio zozose zendazo mwekhigwe uvyazi unu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Aho akawabada na akakwea vituhu ngaawa, akavoka ntambo ya kuita phande ya kaidi ya mazimshindo.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hamila ya Mafalisayo na Helode</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Matayo 16:5-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Wahina wakwe wajaa kudoa mabumunda ya kuiganyia. Ne wawa na bumunda dimwe mwe ngaawa. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Yesu akawaemeza, “Kauwani muno, na mwekae hae na hamila ya Mafalisayo na hamila ya Helode.”<verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Wahina wakavoka kuuzana, “Agombeka ivi kwaviya khatina mabumunda.”<verse eid="MRK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Yesu kamanya ayo ne awamba, “Kwambwai mwauzana mbui ya kwesekupata mabumunda? Nyie khammanya au khamna umanyi? Kwambwai mioyo yenu yatoga? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Mna meso akini khamdaha kuona? Mna magutwi akini khamdaha kutegeeza? Khambukhua? <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />Kisingi kiya nikubenduaho yada mabumunda mashano na kuwekha wantu elufu shano? Mdodoa ngahu nyingahi za phugutio za khade za vyekusigaavyo?” Wahina wakatambaisa, “Ni ngahu kumi dimwe na viidi.”<verse eid="MRK 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />Yesu akawauza, “Na hada nikubenduao yada mabumunda mfungate na kuwekha wantu elufu nne wakada, mdodoa ngahu nyingahi za phugutio za khande za vyekusigaavyo?” Ne wamtambaisa, “Ni ngahu mfungate.”<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Aho akawauza, “Khamzati kumanya?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amhonya mntu tuntu uko Betisaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Yesu akabua mzi wetangwao Betisaida hamwe na wahinyi wakwe. Uko wantu wakamwegaiya mntu tuntu, wakamheembeza amdonte. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Yesu akamtoza mkono yuda tuntu na kumlavya chongoi ya mzi. Akamswiia ovu mwe meso, akamwiikia mikono kwe meso na kumuuza, “Wadaha koona chochose?”<verse eid="MRK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Yuda tuntu akakauwa na kugombeka, “Naona wantu wakenda inga miti yendayo.”<verse eid="MRK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Naho Yesu akamwiikia vituhu mikono yakwe mwe meso ya yuda tuntu, naye yuda mntu akafua meso, ne meso yakavuguka, koona kwakwe kukamuuiya akoona kia kintu pwii. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Yesu akamwamba aite kaya na kumuemeza, “Naho usekwengia mwe mzi.”<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo agombeka pwii Yesu ne Klistu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Matayo 16:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka 9:18-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Naho Yesu na wahina wakwe wakaita mwe mizi ya hehi na Kaisalia Filipi. Wekuwaho siai Yesu akawauza wahina wakwe, “Wantu wamba mie nndai?”<verse eid="MRK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Wakamtambaisa, “Watuhu wamba wee ni Yohana mbatiiza, watuhu wamba u Eliya na watuhu wamba ni yumwe wa Waoni wa Muungu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Yesu akawauza, “Na nywie mwamba mie nndai?” Petulo akagombeka, “Wee ne Klistu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Naho Yesu akawaemeza wasekugombeka kwa mntu yoyose mbui zakwe.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu agombeka mbui ya suuba, ufe na kuyuyuka kwakwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Matayo 16:21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luka 9:22-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Naho Yesu akavoka kuwahinya wahina wakwe, nlazima Mwana wa Mntu ekhigwe usuumizi mwingi na kuemewa na wadaa na Waviki wakuu na Wahinyi wa Miko. Enda akomwe, akini mwe msi wa ntatu enda ayuyuke. <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Yesu kagombeka mbui ida pwiii. Aho Petulo akamdoa Yesu khandani, na kuvoka kumuakia. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Akini Yesu akahituka na kuwakauwa wahina wakwe, akamuakia Petulo na akamba, “Hauke hemeso yangu Ibiisi wee! Umamakhanyo wako khio wa Muungu iya ni wa kiuntu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Naho akawetanga zumwezumwe da wantu hamwe na wahina wakwe akawamba, “Inga mntu yoyose akakunda kunitongea nlazima eemee mwenye, enue mhamba wakwe anitongee. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Kwaviya mntu yoyose akundae kuohoa ugima wakwe mwenye enda awaze, akini mntu mwaza ugima wakwe kwaajii ya mie na kwaajii ya Mbui Yedi za Muungu enda ayaohoe. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Mntu enda ekhigwe mbwai inga akekhigwa vintu vyose vya inusi na kuwaza ugima wakwe? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Khahana kintu wendacho ukilavye ili uupate ugima? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Mntu yoyose mwenda anionee soni mie na mahinyo yangu, mwe uvyazi unu wa kianga na cha mavigaviga, Mwana wa Mntu enda amuonee soni mntu uyo, kisingi endaho auye he ukuu wa Tati yakwe hamwe na wandima wa Muungu wa uwanga.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Yesu akatendesa kugombeka, “Nawamba kwei, kuna wantu watuhu aha khawana wauye na nyuma, hadi wendaho wauone Useuta wa Muungu ukeza kwa udaho.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahituka cheni</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Matayo 17:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka 9:28-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Yekwembokaho misi mtandatu, Yesu akawadoa Petulo na Yakobo na Yohana, akaita nao uwanga ya muima ulehao kwesaho wantu. Uko Yesu akahituka cheni hemeso yao. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Nguo zakwe zikang'aa pee, ung'ao wakwe khahana mnyukuaji yoyose mwe inusi mdaha kunyukuua nguo zing'ae inga izo. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Naho Eliya na Musa wakalawiia wakatamwiiya na Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Petulo akamwamba Yesu, “Mhinyi, ni vitana sie tiwe aha. Ebae tikazenga makumbi matatu, dimwe dako, dimwe da Musa na dimwe da Eliya.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Petulo na weziwe wakaogoha muno hata wasekumanya da kugombeka.<verse eid="MRK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Naho kukalawia zunde dikawagubika, na mgutio ukategeezeka kulawa mwe dia zunde, “Uyu ne Mwanangu wa kigosi nimkundaye mtegeezeni.” <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Ahoaho wahina wakakaua vituhu, akini khawekumwona mntu mtuhu iya Yesu ikedu.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Aho wekuwaho wakaseea kulawa kwe muima, Yesu akawaemeza, wasekumwamba mntu mbui zozose wekuzionazo, adi aho Mwana wa Mntu endaho ayuyuke.<verse eid="MRK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Aho wakatoza miagiiyo iyo, akini wakauzana, mana ya kuyuyuka ni mbwai? <verse eid="MRK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Wahina wakamuuza Yesu, “Kwambwai Wahinyi wa Miko wagombeka, Eliya akundigwa avoke kweza?”<verse eid="MRK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Yesu akawatambaisa, “Ni kwei, Eliya avoke kweza na kuika mbui zose vitana. Ata ivyo kwambwai iandikwa mwe Maandiko ya Mungu, Mwana wa Mntu enda asumizwe muno na kubewa? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Akini nawamba Eliya keza kae naho wakamgosoa wakundavyo inga Maandiko yekugombekavyo kwaajii yakwe.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amhonya mbwanga mwenye mazaiko</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Matayo 17:14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43a">Luka 9:37-43a</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Naho wekuwabwiaho wada wahina watuhu, ne waona zumwezumwe kuu da wantu diwaikia bunga. Na wamwe wa Wahinyi wa Miko watambaisana nawo. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Ahoaho wada wantu wekumwonaho Yesu, wakahondomaa muno, wakamguukia na kumuugusa. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Yesu akawauza wahina wakwe, “Mwatambaisana mbwai?”<verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Aho mntu yumwe mwe dia zumwezumwe akagombeka, “Mhinyi khimueta mwanangu kwaviya ana mazaiko yekumgosoayo asekudaha kutamwiiya. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Naho zaiko ido dikamkwea mwanangu damgwisa asi na kumtenda alawe fuo mwe kanwa, na akeuma meno naho akakama mwii wose. Kiwamba wahina wako walavye ido zaiko, akini khawekudaha.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Yesu akagombeka, “Nywie kivyazi chesacho kuzumiiya! Nenda nekae na nywie hata ini? Nenda niwazizimize hata ini? Mweeteni hangu!” <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Naho wakamweta yuda mbwanga kwa Yesu. Na dia zaiko dekumuonaho Yesu dikamsingisa, yuda mbwanga akagwa asi, akagaagaa ne alawa fuo mwe kanwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yesu akamuuza tate ya yuda mbwanga, “Mazaiko aya yamvoka ini?” Nee amtambaisa, “Kuvokea udodo wakwe. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Maa zose zaiko idi damgwisa mwe moto na mwe mazi, ili dimkome. Inga ukadaha tifiiye mbazi na kutiambiza!”<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yesu akagombeka, “Ati ukadaha, Mbui zose zadahika kwa yuda azumiiae.”<verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Aho tati yakwe yuda mbwanga akatoa vuzo kwa mgutio mkuu, na akamba “Nakuzumiia, niambiza kwesekudaha kuzumiiya.”<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Yesu ekuonaho zumwezumwe da wantu dagenyea hemeso yakwe, ne amwamba dia zaiko, “Wee zaiko umgosoae mwana uyu asekudaha kugombeka na kutenda kiziba, nakwamba mlawe mbwanga uyu usekumuuwiya vituhu!”<verse eid="MRK 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Aho zaiko dia ne dagutia na kumgea ugwa mtwi na kumgwisa yuda mbwanga asi na kumlawa. Yuda mbwanga akekaa inga kimba hata watuhu ne wamba, “Kauya na nyuma!” <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Akini Yesu akamtoza mkono yuda mbwanga, akamwenua, ne agooka.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Aho, Yesu akengia kaya, wahina wakwe wakamuuza wekuwaho ikedu, “Kwambwai swie khatekudaha kumlavya yuda zaiko?”<verse eid="MRK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Yesu akawamba, “Zaiko inga idi khadidaha kulawa, kwesiho kuvika.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu agombeka vituhu ufe wakwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Matayo 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Luka 9:43b-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Yesu na wahina wakwe walawa hada, ne waita wakembokea Galilaya, Yesu khekukunda wantu wowose wamanye weiho, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />kwaviya ne awahinya wahina wakwe, akawamba, “Mwana wa Mntu enda egalwe kwa wantu wendao wamkome. Akini bada ya msi wa ntatu enda ayuyuke.”<verse eid="MRK 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Akini wahina wakwe khawokumanya mahinyo yada na wakaogoha kumuuza.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nndai mwekuwa Mkuu?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matayo 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka 9:46-48</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Naho wakabua Kapelinaumu, ekuaho kaya, Yesu akawauza wahina wakwe, “Ne mkatambaisana mbwai mwe sia?”<verse eid="MRK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Akini khawokuandua, kwaviya ne wakatambaisana wakamba nndai mkuu gatigati yao. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Yesu akekaa asi, akawetanga wada wahina wakwe kumi dimwe na waidi na kuwamba, “Mntu akakunda awe mgookezi akundigwa awe wa kisikizi na mndima wa wose.” <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Naho akamdoa mwana mdodo akamgoosa gatigati yao, akamuumbatia na kuwamba, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />“Mntu yoyose amhokeae mwana inga uyu kwa zina dangu anihokea mie, naho mntu anihokeaye mie, khanihokea miedu iya amhokeea yuda mwekuniagiiya.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwesekuhigana na swie yu hamwe na swie</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luka 9:49-50</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Yohana akamwamba Yesu, “Mhinyi, timuona mntu yumwe akalavya zaiko kwazina dako, nee tageeza kumweemeza kwaviya khayuko hamwe na swie.”<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Akini Yesu akagombeka, “Msekumweemeza kwaviya khahana mntu agosoae tangio kwa zina dangu, na ahoaho akagombeka ufyaimu wa mbui zangu.” <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Kwaviya mntu yoyose esaye kuhigana nasi, yu hamwe na swie. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Nagombeka kwei mntu yoyose endae amyekhe kikombe cha mazi ya kudomea kwaviya nywie ni wantu wa Klistu, na kwei enda ahokee funge.<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mageezo ya kugosoa mavigaviga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Matayo 18:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luka 17:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />Mntu yoyose endae amkindie yumwe wa awa wadodo wanizumiiyao agosoe mavigaviga ni ebae kwa mntu uyo azongomezwe he singo yakwe iwe kuu da kubundugia na kutambikwa mwe mazimshindo. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Mkono wako ukakutenda kugosoa mavigaviga, uusenge. Ebae wengie mwe ugima kwesaho mkono umwe, kusima na mikono miidi na kwengia mwe moto wa misi yose wesao kukomeka. <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />Umo minyula yakwe khaifa na moto wa misi yose kwesiho kisiikizi. <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Na muundi wako ukakutenda kugosoa mavigaviga uusenge! Ebae kwengia mwe ugima kwesaho muundi umwe kusima na miundi yose miidi na kutambikwa mwe moto wa kae na kae. <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />Uko mafunyo yakwe khayafa na moto wa misi yose wesao kukomeka. <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Ziso dako dikakutenda ugosoe mavigaviga diuse. Ebae kwengia mwe Uzumbe wa Muungu na ziso dimwe kusima na meso yose maidi na kutambwikwa mwe moto wa kae na kae. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Minyula yakwe khaifa na moto wa misi yose kwesiho kisiikizi.<verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Kwaviya kiya yumwe enda agewe munyu kwa moto.<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />“Munyu ni mtana akini inga ikabanika inda ikweezwe na mbwai? Muwe na munyu mwe mioyo yenu na kwekaisa kwevana gatigati yenu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesu auzwa mbui ya kuteguana na kubadana.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Matayo 19:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka 16:18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Yesu akalawa hada na kuita si ya Uyahudi, akadumua zigizigi da mazi da wa Yolodani. Zumwezumwe da wantu dikambasa vituhu, ne awahinya vituhu inga viya agosoavyo.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Aho Mafalisayo watuhu wakambasa na kumuuza kwa kumgeeza wakagombeka, “Miko yamuekea mgosi kumbada mkaziwe?” <verse eid="MRK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Yesu akawatambaisa kwa kuwauza. “Musa kawekha mwiko wani?”<verse eid="MRK 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Wowo wakagombeka, “Musa katiagiiya kuwa mgosi aluusiwa kuandika bauwa ya kumbada mkaziwe.”<verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Yesu akawamba, “Musa kagonda mwiko uwo, kwaajii ya kutoga kwa mioyo yenu.” <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Akini kuvokea kugosolwa inusi, Muungu kaumba mgosi na mvyee. <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />Ivyo mgosi enda ambade tati yakwe na mami yakwe, enda awe hamwe na mkaziwe. <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />Na awa waidi wenda wawe mwii umwe. Kwaivyo wowo khio waidi vituhu iya mwii umwe. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Naho, ekukintanisacho Muungu, mntu asekukibahua.<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Wekwengiaho kaya vituhu, wahina wakwe ne wamuuza Yesu mbui ida. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Akawamba, “Mgosi yoyose ambadae mkaziwe na kutegua mvyee mtuhu, agosoa kianga. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Mvyee naye akambada mgosi yakwe na kutegulwa na mgosi mtuhu, yee nae agosoa kianga.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awajaiya wana wadodo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matayo 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka 18:15-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Wantu wakamwetea Yesu wana wadodo awadonte, akini wahina wakwe wakawaemeza wantu wada. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Yesu ekuonaho ivyo akakimwa, akawamba wahina wakwe, “Waekeeni wana wadodo weze hangu, naho msekuwakindia, kwaviya Uzumbe wa Muungu ni kwa wantu inga awa wana wadodo. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Nawamba kwei, mntu yoyose mwesekuuhokea Useuta wa Muungu inga mwana mdodo, khana engie umo.” <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Akawahokea wana wada akawaumbatia na kuwaikia mikono kwa kuwajaiya.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mntu mwekuwa na mai nyingi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matayo 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka 18:18-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Yesu ekuvokaho ntambo yakwe, mntu yumwe nee amguukia, akakin'ta mavindi hemeso yakwe, akamuuza, “Mhinyi yedi, nitende viivihi nidahe kuhokea ugima wa misi yose kwesiho kisiikizi?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yesu akamtambaisa, “Kwambwai wanetanga yedi? Khahana mntu yedi iya Muungu ikedu. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Miko waimanya, ‘Usekuwa mkianga, Usekukoma, Usekubawa, Usekugombeka uhonko, Usekutiiya Wategeeze tati yako na mami yako.’”<verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Nee amtambaisa, “Mhinyi, ayo yose khiyatozeeza kuvokea udodo wangu.”<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Yesu akamkauwa akamkundisa akamwamba, “Kuhungukiwa na kintu kimwe. Hita ukatage vyose wenavyo navyo uwekhe hea wakiwa, nawe wenda uwe na utajii mwingi uwanga kwa Muungu naho unibase.” <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Ekutegeezavyo ayo, ne agumia, na kuhauka kwa usungu, kwaviya ne kawa na mai nyingi.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Yesu akamagaza magaza kia phande na kuwamba wahina wakwe, “Yenda iwe vyatoga kwa mwenye mai kwengia mwe Useuta wa Muungu!”<verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Wahina wakwe wakahondomaa kwa ida mbui, akini Yesu akawamba vituhu, “Wanangu, vyatoga muno kwa wenye mai kwengia mwe Useuta wa Muungu! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Vyadahika ng'ombe kwengia mwe ntundu ya singano iya khaidaika kwa mntu mwe mai kwengia kwe Useuta wa Muungu.”<figure style="fig" file="14 Camel.jpg" size="col" ref="10:25">Ngamia</figure><verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Wahina ne wahondomaa na kuuzana, “Nndai mwenda adahae kuoholwa?”<verse eid="MRK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yesu akawafuiya meso na kuwamba, “Kwa wantu khavidahika, akini kwa Muungu vintu vyose vyadahika.”<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Naho Petulo akamwamba, “Kauwa, tibada vyose, tikakutongea weye.”<verse eid="MRK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yesu akagombeka, “Nawamba kwei, kia mntu mwekubada kaya, na wanduguze wa kigosi na maumbu zakwe na mami yakwe na tati yakwe na wanawe na minda yakwe kwaajii ya mie na Mbui Zedi, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />enda ahokee maa mia kisingi cha isasa, kaya na wanduguze wa kigosi na maumbu na mame na wana na minda hamwe na suuba. Na mwe kisingi chezacho enda ahokee ugima wa kae na kae. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Akini wantu wangi wabosi wenda wawe wa kisikizi, na wakisikizi wenda wawe wabosi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu agombeka maa ya ntatu mbui ya ufe na kuyuyuka kwakwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matayo 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka 18:31-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Naho wawa siai kuita Yelusalemu, na Yesu ne mwekuwaongweea, wahina wakwe wakamema maatu, na wantu wekuwatongeao nee waogoha. Yesu akawadoa wada wahina kumi dimwe na waidi akavoka kuwamba mbui zendazo zimlawie. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />“Tegeezani, taita Yelusalemu uko Mwana wa Mntu enda ekhiizwe kwa Waviki Wakuu na Wahinyi wa Miko wendao wamuamwiie akomwe na kumwekhiiza kwa wantu wesiho Wayahudi. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Naho wenda wambee na kumswiia ovu na kumtoa na koto na kumkoma, akini mwe msi wa ntatu enda ayuyuke.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobo na Yohana weegaa ombezo kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Matayo 20:20-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Naho, Yakobo na Yohana wana wa Zebedayo, ne wambasa Yesu na kumwamba, “Mhinyi, takunda utigosoee kintu tendacho tiombeze.”<verse eid="MRK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Yesu akawauza, “Mwonda niwagosoee mbwai?”<verse eid="MRK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Ne wamtambaisa, “Hada wendaho wekae mwe kigoda chako cha ukuu cha Uzumbe, takunda tekae hamwe nawe, utigosoe kwekaa yumwe phande yako ya kumuso na mtuhu phande yako ya kuume.”<verse eid="MRK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Yesu akawamba, “Khammanya ido mdiombezado. Mwadaha kuzizimiza kusuubikaa inga nendavyo nisuubike? Naho mwenda muwe tayali kuuya na nyuma inga nendavyo niuye na nyuma?”<verse eid="MRK 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Wakamtambaisa, “Tadaha” Yesu akawamba, “Suuba nendazo nipate mwendamzizimize kusuubika kwei, naho kwei mwenda muuye na nyuma inga nendavyo niuye na nyuma mie. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Akini khidaha kusagua ni yuhi endae ekae phande ya kuume hambu kumoso kwangu. Ni Muungu ne ahiganyaye yuhi ekae phande ya kuume hambu kumoso kwa wada ekuwasaguao.”<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Wada wahina watuhu kumi dimwe wekutegeezaho mbui ida wekuombezayo Yakobo na Yohana ne wakimwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Yesu akawetanga wose na kugombeka, “Mwamanya kuwa wada wamamakhanywao kuwa waongoezi wa si wawagookea wantu wao kwa mdundugo, na wakuu awo wawashuutiza wantu wao. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Akini kwenu isekuwa ivyo, iya akundae kuwa mkuu gatigati yenu akundigwa awe mndima yenu. <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />Mntu yoyose akundae kuwa mwoongoezi wa wantu, akundigwa awe mndima wa wose. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Kwaviya Mwana wa Mntu khekweza kugosoewa ndima, iya keza kugosoea wantu ndima na kulavya ugima wakwe kwajii ya kuohoa wantu wangi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amhonya Batimayo tuntu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matayo 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka 18:35-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Naho wakabua Yeliko, Yesu ekuwaho akahauka mwe mzi uwo na wahina wakwe hamwe na zumwezumwe da wantu, tuntu yumwe etangwaye Batimayo mwana wa Timayo ne kekaa khandakhanda ya sia akaombeza. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Batimayo ekusikiaho Yesu Mnazaleti emboka hantu aho, ne avoka kukema, “Yesu! Mwana wa Daudi! Nifiie mbazi!”<verse eid="MRK 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Wantu wangi wakamwakia na kumwamba anyamae, akini ne aendeea kukema, “Mwana wa Daudi, nifiiye mbazi!”<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Yesu nee kagooka na kugombeka, “Mwetangeni.” Wakamwetanga yuda tuntu, nee wamwamba, “Ekhe moyo! Gooka akwetanga.”<verse eid="MRK 10:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Akatambika gwanda dakwe, akahauka kinyinyio na kumbasa Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 10:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Yesu ne amuuza, “Wakunda nikugosoee mbwai?” Uyo tuntu akamwamba, “Mhinyi, nakunda nione.”<verse eid="MRK 10:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Yesu akamwamba, “Hita kuzumiiya kwako kukuhonya.” Ahoaho akoona, akamtongea Yesu na kuita nae.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yesu engia Yelusalemu kwa nyemi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matayo 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohana 12:12-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Wekuwaho wa hehi na Yelusalemu, hehi ya mizi ya Betifage na Besaniya, kwe muima wa mizaituni. Yesu akawaagiia wahina wakwe waidi. <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />Akawamba, “Hitani mwe mzi wehehi yenu. Mkabua uko mwenda mbwiie mwanaphunda kazengetezwa, naho khazati kugosoewa ndima. Mchopoeni mkamweete. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Ati mntu akawauza, ‘Kwambwai mwagosoa ivi?’ Mmwambe, ‘Zumbe amkunda na enda amvuze isasa.’”<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Naho, wakaita, wakambwiiya mwanaphunda siai kafungwa he uvi. Wekuwaho wamchopoa, <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />wamwe wa wantu wekuwaho wagooka aho wakawauza, “Kwambwai mwamchopoa uyo mwanaphunda?”<verse eid="MRK 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Wahina wakawatambaisa inga viya wekwembigwavyo ni Yesu, naho wakawaeka waite. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Wakamwegaiiya Yesu yuda mwanaphunda, wakatandika nguo uwanga ya yuda mwanaphunda, Yesu ne ekaa uwanga yakwe. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Wantu wangi watandaza nguo zao siai, watuhu nao watandaza vihuto vya miti wekusengayo mwe minda kwaajii ya kumtogoa. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Wantu wose wekuongoao na wada wekuwabasao, wakalavya mgutio wakagombeka, “Zumbe atogolwe! Ajaiwe yuda ezae kwa zina da Zumbe! <verse eid="MRK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Ujaiwe Uzumbe wezao wa zumbe Daudi tati yetu! Atogolwe Muungu mwe uko uwanga muno!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Yesu akengia mwe mzi wa Yelusalemu, akaita mwe Nyumba ya Muungu na kukauwa kia kintu. Akini kwaviya ne diswa, akaita mwe mzi wa Besaniya hamwe na wahina wakwe kumi dimwe na waidi.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aubadia lazi mti wa mtini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Matayo 21:18-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Msi wekutongeao wekuwaho wakauya kulawa Besaniya, Yesu akaumwa nsaa. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Aho kwa hae akaona mti umanyikanao kwa zina da mtini wenye mani mangi, ne aubasa aukaue inga enda apate tini. Ekubuaho akaubwiia khauna tini iya manidu, kwaviya kisingi chakwe cha kuvyaa khakizati kubua. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Aho Yesu akawamba mtini, “Kuvokea ivyeo hadi misi zose khahana mntu endae ade tini kulawa kwako vituhu.” Na wahina wakwe wakaitegeeza mbui iyo.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu engia he Nyumba ya Muungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matayo 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohana 2:13-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Wakabua mzi wa Yelusalemu, Yesu akengia mwe Nyumba ya Muungu akavoka kuwaguusa wantu wose wekuwaho wakataga na kugua vintu. Akahitua meza za wada wabadiishao hea na kugwisa viti vya wada watagao suwa, <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />khekukunda mntu yoyose kwembokea kwe buha da Nyumba ya Muungu kudoa kintu chochose. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Naho ne awahinya, “Igondwa, ‘Nyumba yangu yetangwa Nyumba ya kuvikia kwaajii ya wantu wa si zose!’ Akini nywie muitenda phanga da wahokaji.”<verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Waviki wakuu hamwe na Wahinyi wa Miko, wekutegezavyo mbui izo, wakavoka kuondeza sia ya kumkoma Yesu. Akini wakamuogoha Yesu kwaajii ya wantu wose wekuhondomaao kwa mahinyo yakwe.<verse eid="MRK 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Ikubuaho guoni, Yesu na wahina wakwe wakahauka mwe mzi uda.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahinyo kulawa mwe mti wa mtini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Matayo 21:20-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Keokeo da mtungaihu, wekuwaho wakemboka ne wauwona uda mtini unyaa wose hadi kwe sina. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Petulo akakumbuka akamwamba Yesu, “Mhinyi, kaua uda mtini wekuubadiao lazi, unyaa!”<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Yesu akatambaisa, “Mzumieni Muungu.” <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Nawamba kwei mntu akawamba muima unu, ng'oka uketambike mwe mazimshindo naye khana matumatu mwe moyo wakwe, akini akazumiia mbui zose agombekazo zagosoka, enda agosoewe mbui iyo. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Kwaajii iyo nawagombekani, mvikaho na kuombeza kintu chochose, zumiani kwamba mkihokea, nacho chenda kiwe chenu. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Nyie mgookaho kuvika, mwekeeni kia mntu mwekukubanangia chochose, ili Tati yenu mwe uwanga awaekee masa yenu. <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Akini mwesekuwaekea watuhu, hata Tati yenu mwe uko uwanga kwa Muungu khana awaekee masa yenu.<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Udaho wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matayo 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka 20:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Naho wakabua Yelusalemu vituhu, Yesu ekuwaho akaita he Nyumba ya Muungu, Waviki wakuu na Wahinyi wa Miko na wadaa waongoezi wakambasa, <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />wakamuuza, “Ni kwa udaho uhi wagosoa mbui izi? Naho nndai mwekukwekha udaho wa kugosoa mbui izi?”<verse eid="MRK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yesu akawatambaisa, “Nendaniwauze mbui mwenga, mkanitambaisa nami nendaniwambe nagosoa aya kwa udaho wa ndai. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Nigombekani, udaho wa ubatiizo wa Yohana walawa kwa Muungu au walawa kwa wantu?”<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Wakavoka kuuzana, “Tikamba walawa uko uwanga kwa Muungu endaatiuze, ‘Kwambwai khamwekumzumiia Yohana?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Na tikamba, ‘Ulawiiya kwa wantu.’ ” Wakaogoha zumwezumwe da wantu kwaajii wose wamzumiiya Yohana kwei ni muoni wa Muungu. <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Aho wakamtambaisa Yesu, “Swie khatimanya.” Yesu akawamba, “Mie nami khinaniwambe nagosoa mbui izi kwa udaho wa ndai.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Msimo wa mnda wa mizabibu na waimi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matayo 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka 20:9-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Naho Yesu akavoka kugombeka nao kwa misimo, “Mntu yumwe kaima mnda wa mizabibu akazenga ukanto, na gatigati akagosoa hantu ha kukamuiia divai, akazenga mnaa aho. Naho akauazima uda mnda kwa waimi akatamba kuita si ya hae.”<figure style="fig" file="04 Winepress.jpg" size="col" ref="12:1">Wantu waidi wakamuwa zabibu hantu ha kukamuiiya divai</figure> <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Kisingi cha ubosi chekubuaho, akamwagiiya mndima wakwe kwa wada waimi, amwetee fungu dakwe da ubosi da yuda mwenye mnda. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Wada waimi wakamgwiiya, yuda mndima wakamtoa na kumvuza bue. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Mwenye mnda akamwagiiya mndima mtuhu, uyu nae wakamtoa mwe mtwi na kumtenda vyesavyo kutama. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Yuda mwenye mnda akamwagiiya mndima mtuhu, awo waimi wakamkoma na mwenye mnda akawaagiiya watuhu wangi, wakatoigwa na wangi wakakomwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Mwenye mnda akasigaa na mntu yumwe ni mwanawe amkundisae. Nae akamwagiiya uyo akagombeka, “Wenda wamtunye mwanangu!” <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Akini wada waimi wakaambizana, “Uyo ne mpazi haya timkome, upazi utende wetu.” <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Kwaiyo wakamgwiiya, wakamkoma na kumtambika chongoi ya uda mnda wa mizabibu.<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Aho Yesu akawauza, “Mwenye mnda endaatende viivihi? Endaeze awadagamize awo waimi na kuazimisha mnda uwo wa mizabibu kwa waimi watuhu. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Khamzati kusoma Maandiko aya? ‘Iwe dekuemewado na wazengi isasa diwa iwe kuu da khandani. <verse eid="MRK 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Zumbe ne mwekugosoa mbui inu, nado ni utangio kwetu!’”<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Waviki wakuu, Wahinyi wa Miko na wadaa wamanya yakuwa msimo uwo wawausu, wakageeza kumgwiya akini wakaogoha zumwezumwe da wantu aho wakambada wakaita.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuiha kodi kwa Seuta mkuu wa Lumi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matayo 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka 20:20-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Naho, wamwe wa Mafalisayo na kizumwezumwe cha Helode, wakaagiiwa kwa Yesu wamtege kwa mbui zakwe. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Wakambasa Yesu wakamwamba, “Mhinyi tamanya wee ni mntu mzumizi, ugombekaye ukwei. Naho khukauwa ukuu wa mntu yoyose, akini wahinya kwei sia ya Muungu. Ni vyedi kuiha kodi kwa Seuta mkuu wa Lumi? Tiihe hambu tesekuiha?”<verse eid="MRK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Akini Yesu ne amanya uhokho wao. Akawatambaisa, “Kwa mbwai mwanigeeza? Nekhani sensi niikauwe.”<verse eid="MRK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Wakamwegaiya sensi mwenga ne awauza, “Cheni na idi zina ni da ndai?” Ne wamtambaisa, “Ni vya Seuta mkuu wa Lumi.”<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Aho Yesu akawamba, “Ni vyedi mwekheni Seuta mkuu wa Lumi ayo yakwe na Muungu mwekheni yakwe.” Wakahondomazwa muno nae.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbui ya uyuyuko</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matayo 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka 20:27-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Naho, wamwe wa Masadukayo wamba khakuna kuyuyuka, wakambasa Yesu na kumuuza, <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />“Mhinyi, Musa katiagiiya ivi, ‘Mntu akauya na nyuma na kumbada mkaziwe kwesiho kuvyaa. Nduguye akundigwa amdoe yuda mvyee mwekufiwa ni mgosi, adahe kumvyaia wana.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Naho nekuwa na ndugu mfungate, yuda wa bosi kategua, akauya na nyuma kwesiho kubada mwana. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Ndugu wakaidi naye akampaa yuda mvyee mwekufiwa ni mgosi, akini yee naye akauya na nyuma kwesiho kubada mwana. Viyaviya ndugu wa ntatu akauya na nyuma. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Wose mfungate wakauya na nyuma kwesiho kubada mwana. Ne yuda mvyee naye mwekufiwa ni mgosi akauya na nyuma. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Aho, msi wantu wendaho wayuyuke, mvyee uyo endaawe mkaza ndai? Kwaviya wose mfungate ne wamtegua.”<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yesu akawatambaisa, “Nyie mwaga kwaviya khammanya Maandiko ya Muungu wala udaho wa Muungu. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Kwaviya wantu wendaho wayuyuke, khawana wategue wala kutegulwa, iya wendawawe inga wandima wa uwanga wa Muungu. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Akini mbui ya kuyuyuka kwa wekufao, khamzati kusoma mwe kitabu cha Musa hantu ambaho kada katundugua kekuwacho chaka moto? Muungu akamwamba Musa, ‘Mie ni Muungu wa Ibulahimu na Muungu wa Isaka na Muungu wa Yakobo.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Yee ni Muungu wa wantu wagima, na khio Muungu wa wada wekuuyao na nyuma. Ivyo mbanikiwa muno!”<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwiko mkuu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Matayo 22:34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka 10:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Mhinyi yumwe wa miko akabua hada, akategeeza wahiganavyo. Ekuonaho Yesu kawatambaisa vitana yuda Sadukayo, ne ambasa Yesu na kumuuza, “Mwe amli zose ni ihi ya bosi?” <verse eid="MRK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Yesu akamtambaisa, “Mwiko mkuu ni unu, ‘Tegeezani nywie wantu wa Isilaeli! Zumbe Muungu yetu ni yumwe Zumbe ikedu. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Mkunde Zumbe Muungu yako kwa moyo wako wose, kwa muye wako wose, na kwa akii zako zose na kwa mdundugo wako wose.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Ya kaidi ni inu, ‘Mkunde mwenzio inga wekundisavyo mwenye.’ Khahana mwiko mkuu mtuhu kusima inu miidi.”<verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Aho yuda Mhinyi wa Miko akamwamba Yesu, “Kugombeka vyedi Mhinyi! Muungu ni yumwe du na khahana Muungu mtuhu inga yee. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Naho yakundigwa mntu amkundise Muungu kwa moyo wose na kwa muye wose na kwa akii zose na kwa udaho wose, na kumkundisa mwenzio inga wekundisavyo mwenye. Mbui inu ni ntana kusima malavyo na ntambiko.”<verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Yesu ekuonaho yuda mntu kamtambaisa kwa kutintimaa akamwamba, “Wee khuho hae na Uzumbe wa Muungu.” Bada ya mbui ida khahana mntu yoyose mwekudaha kumuuza vituhu mbui yoyose.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Klistu ekusagulwaye ni Muungu nndai</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matayo 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka 20:41-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Naho kisingi Yesu ekuwaho akahinya kwe Nyumba ya Muungu, akawauza, Wahinyi wa Miko wamba Klistu ni mwana Daudi? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />“Daudi mwenye akaongoewa na Muye wa Muungu akagombeka. ‘Zumbe akamwamba Zumbe yangu, ekaa mkono wangu wa kudiiya, hadi nendaho niwaike wamasa wako asi he miundi yako.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Daudi mwenye amwetanga Klistu Zumbe, aho Klistu endaawe viivihi mwanawe?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 12:37">Yesu awamba wantu kwekaa hae na Wahinyi wa Miko</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 12:37">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matayo 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luka 20:45-47</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Zumwezumwe da wantu ne wakamtegeeza Yesu kwa kinyemi. <verse eid="MRK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Yesu ekuwaho awahinya ne awamba, “Ekaani hae na Wahinyi wa Miko, wakundao kwemboka emboka wevaia khanzu zilehazo na kuuguswa ni wantu kwa tunyo mwe gwiiyo, wakunda kwekaa hantu ha tunyo he Nyumba ya kukintania Wayahudi, <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />Wakunda kwekaa viti vya hemeso mwe Nyumba ya kuvikia Wayahudi na kwekhigwa phasi ha ntunyo mwe ntafuno. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Wawakonya wavyee wekufiwao ni wagosi naho wegosoa kuvika kisingi kilehacho! Msi wa kuamuiwa wendawekhigwe sugusa khai!”<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malavyo ya mmaa mwekufiwa ni mgosi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luka 21:1-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Yesu ekuwaho kekaa hehi na ntezu ya kuikia malavyo. Akawakauwa wantu wangi waavyavyo hea na kuika mwe ntezu ya Nyumba ya Muungu. Wantu wenye mai nyingi walavya hea nyingi. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Aho ne eza mmaa yumwe mkiwa mwekufiwa ni mgosi, akalavya sensi mbii za shaba. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Aho Yesu akawetanga wahina wakwe akawamba, “Nawamba kwei mmaa uyu mkiwa mwekufiwa ni mgosi kagea hea nyingi mwe ntezu ya malavyo kusima wose wekulavyao. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Kwaviya Watuhu wose walavya mai zekuwamemeazo, akini uyu mmaa mwe ukiwa wakwe kalavya vyose ekuwavyonavyo hata kia chakumwambiza mwe ugima wakwe.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Yesu agombeka kubomolwa kwa Nyumba ya Muungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Matayo 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luka 21:5-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Yesu ekuwaho akalawa mwe Nyumba ya Muungu, mhina wakwe yumwe akamwamba, “Mhinyi, kauwa maiwe aya na mazengo yekuwavyo matana muno!”<verse eid="MRK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Yesu akamwamba, “Wayaona mazengo aya makuu? Khahana hata iwe dimwe dendado disigae uwanga ya ntuhu, yose yenda yatulwe.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Suuba na usuumizi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Matayo 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luka 21:7-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Yesu ekuwaho kekaa kwe muima wa Mizaituni na kukauwa Nyumba ya Muungu, Petulo na Yakobo na Yohana na Andulea wakamuuza kwesiho wantu. <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Tambie mbui izo zendazilawie ini? Na utangio wakwe ni uhi wendaoutimanyise mbui izi zihehi kubua?”<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Yesu akavoka kuwamba, “Ekauweni mwesekutiiwa ni mntu yoyose.” <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Wangi wendaweze na kwetanga kwa zina dangu, kia yumwe endaagombeke, “Mie nee Klistu!” Naho wendawawatiie wantu wangi. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Mwendaho mtegeeze mbui ya khondo kwa hae na vuzo da khondo kwa hehi, mwesekuwa na maatu. Mbui izo zakundigwa zilawie, akini mbui iyo khaizati kubua. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Wantu wa si mwenga wendawatowane na wantu wa si ntuhu, wantu wa useuta umwe wendawatoane na wantu wa useuta mtuhu, naho kia hantu hendahawe na mizingizo ya inusi na baa da saa. Mbui izi inga usungu wa bosi wa kuvyaa mwana.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />Akini nywie mwekae meso, kwaviya wendawawegae mwe kifungo na kuwatoa mwe Nyumba ya kuvikia Wayahudi. Mwendamwegalwe hemeso ya wagookezi na maseuta kwaajii yangu, ili muwambe Mbui Yedi. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Akini yakundigwa Mbui Yedi ya Muungu ivoke kubiikiwa kwa wantu wa si zose, kabla khakizati kubua kisingi cha kisikizi. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Naho wendaho wawagwiiye na kuwegaa ha kuamuiwa, msekuogoha mwendamgombeke mbwai, mda wendaho ubue dodose mwendado mwekhigwe gombekani. Kwaviya khio nywie mgombekao iya ni Muye wa Muungu. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Mntu endaamhituke nduguye akomwe, na tate endaamhituke mwanawe. Wana nao wendawawahituke wavyazi wao na kuwakoma. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Wantu wose wendawakimwe na nywie Kwaajii yangu, iya mwendaazizimize adi kubua kisikizi ne endaye aoholwe.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Suuba khuu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Matayo 24:15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka 21:20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />Muonaho ufyaimu ugooka hantu kwesiho hakwe, mmanyisi na amanye mana yakwe aho, wada weiho Uyahudi waguukie kwe miima. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Yuda mwe uwanga ya nyumba asekuseea asi kwengia mwe nyumba yakwe kudoa kintu chochose. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Mntu mwekuwa mwe mnda asekuuya kaya kudoa nguo yakwe. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Wendawakione wavyee wekwenuao maifu na wada waokhesao msi uwo! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Mwombezeni Muungu mbui izo zesekulawia kisingi cha pheho. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Kwaviya kisingi icho chendakiwe cha suuba khuu na khakizati kulawiiya kuvokea aho Muungu ekugosoavyo inusi hadi ivyeo, naho khayezakulawiiya vituhu. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Inga Zumbe khekuwa ahunguzie misi izo khahana mntu mwendayeaoholwe, akini kwaajii ya wantu wakwe ekuwasaguao Zumbe kahunguza misi izo.<verse eid="MRK 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />“Naho mntu yoyose akawamba, Kauwani, Klistu yuaha, au yu kuda! Msekuzumiia.” <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Kwaviya wendawalawie maklistu wa utiizi na waoni wa utiizi, wendawagosoe vihii na viozo, kwaajii ya kuwaza hata wada wekusagulwao ni Muungu, inga vikadahika. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Akini nywie mwekae meso! Kwaviya khiwagombekea mbui zose zekuwazo khazizati kulawiiya.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kweza kwakwe Mwana wa Mntu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matayo 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka 21:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />“Mwe misi izo, suuba khuu ikemboka, zua dendadigewe kiza na mweenge khauna ung'ae.” <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />Ntoondo zendazigwe kulawa uwanga na mdundugo wa uwanga kwe mazunde wendausingisike. <verse eid="MRK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Aho Mwana wa Mntu endaalawie akeza mwe mazunde kwa udaho na ukuu. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Naye endaawagiiye wandima wa uwanga kwa Muungu kuwaika hamwe wantu wose wekusagulwao ni Muungu, kulawiiya phande zose nne za inusi, kulawiiya kisikizi cha inusi hadi kisikizi cha mmbingu.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Msimo wa mtini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:31-35">Matayo 24:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka 21:29-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />“Kauwani msimo wa mti wa mtini na mwehinye. Aho matambi yakwe yavoka kutenda mateke na kulavya mani, mmanye kisingi cha ubosi kihehi.” <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Viyaviya muonaho mbui izo zikalawia, mmanye Mwana wa Mntu yu hehi kwe uvi kweza. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Nawamba kwei, kivyazi iki khakinachemboke hadi mbui zose izo zendahozilawie. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Mmbingu na inusi zendazemboke, akini mbui zangu khazina zemboke katu.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khahana mntu amanyae msi na saa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Matayo 24:36-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />Akini khahana mntu amanyae msi na saa hata wandima wa uwanga kwa Muungu, na Mwana khamanya, iya Tate ikedu ne amanyae. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Muwe tayali kwaviya khammanya kisingi icho chenda kibue ini. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Yendaiwe inga mntu alawaye kaya na kuita ntambo akawabadia wandima wakwe waikaue na waigookee, kia yumwe akamwekha ndima yakwe yakugosoa, akamwamba yuda semgoja “Asekugona.” <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Mwekae tayali kwaviya khammanya mwenye kaya endaauye ini, yadahika ni guoni, kio kikuu, keokeo da mtungaihu au keo. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Mwekae tayali ili akeza vuupu asekweza akawabwiiya mgona. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Niwambavyo nywie nawamba wose, mwekae tayali!<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">Nteganyi za kumkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matayo 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohana 11:45-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Nezisigaa misi miidi kabla khaizati kubua sikukhuu ya Pasaka na ya mabumunda yesayokugewa hamila. Waviki wakuu na wahinyi wa miko wakaondeza sia ya kumgwiiya Yesu kwa unyanyi na kumkoma. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Akini wakamba, “Tesekumgwiya kisingi cha sikukhuu ya Pasaka, wantu wesekweza wakatikweea khumbizi.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu etiiwa malashi uko Besaniya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matayo 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yohana 12:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Yesu ne yumwe mzi wa Besaniya, mwe nyumba ya Simoni mntu mwekuwa na utamu wa nyoka. Aho Yesu ekuwaho akada khande ne engia mvyee yumwe mwekuwa na nchupa ya iwe yetangwayo alibasta yenye mavuta yanukhiayo vitana ya hela nyingi. Akaitua ida nchupa na kumwetiia mavuta Yesu mwe mtwi. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Wamwe wa wantu wekuwaho aho wakakimwa na mbui ida wakauzana, “Kwambwai mavuta aya matana yaga buebue? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Mavuta ayo ne yadahika kutangwa kwa sensi nyingi na sensi izo wakekhigwa wakiwa!” Wakamwakia yuda mvyee.<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Akini Yesu akawamba, “Mweekeni kwambwai mwampisha? Kanigosweea mbui ntana. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Wakiwa mnao misi yose, mwadaha kuwaambiza kisingi chochose mkundacho. Akini mie khinaniwe hamwe na nywie misi yose. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Mvyee uyu kagosoa viya ekudahavyo, kaongoa kuusisa mwii wangu mavuta kwaajii ya kuandaia maziko yangu. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Nawambeni kwei, hantu hohose mwe inusi Mbui Yedi yendaho ibiikiwe, mbui inu ekugosoayo uyu mvyee yenda itamwiiwe kwa khumbuso da yuda mvyee.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda akubai kumhituka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Matayo 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka 22:3-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Naho Yuda Isikaliote yumwe wa wada wahina kumi dimwe na waidi, akaita kwa waviki wakuu ili kumhituka Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Waviki wakuu wekutegeezaho mbui izo, ne wawa na nyemi, wakamwikia kiaga cha kumwekha hela. Aho Yuda akavoka kuondeza phasi ya kumhituka Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ada khande ya sikukhuu ya Pasaka na wahina wakwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Matayo 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luka 22:7-14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohana 13:21-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Mwe msi wa bosi mwe sikukhuu ya mabumunda yesayokugewa hamila, kisingi ambaho mwanangoto wa Pasaka adumulwa singo, wahina wakwe wakamuuza Yesu, “Wakunda tikwikie hahi ntafuno ya Pasaka?”<verse eid="MRK 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Naho Yesu akawagiiya wahina wakwe waidi, akawamba, “Hitani kwe mzi na umo mwendamkintane na mgosi yumwe kenua biga da mazi. Mtongeeni, <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />hadi mwe kaya endayoengie, mkamwambe mwenye kaya, ‘Mhinyi amba, nihahi gati nendaho nidiie khande ya Pasaka hamwe na wahina wangu?’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Naye enda awonyeshe gati khuu yeuko uwanga kwe goofa chekuikwacho tayali, tiikieni umo.”<verse eid="MRK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Wahina wakahauka wakaita kwe mzi, wakabwiiya kia kintu nsawa inga Yesu ekuwagombekeavyo. Ne waiika ntafuno ya sikukhuu ya Pasaka.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Yekubuaho guoni Yesu akabua hamwe na wahina wakwe kumi dimwe na waidi. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Wekuwaho wakada khande Yesu akawamba, “Kwei nawamba yumwe yenu mda nami, enda anihituke.”<verse eid="MRK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Wada wahina wakagumia mioyo wakamuuza Yesu yumweyumwe, “Hambu, ni mie?”<verse eid="MRK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Yesu akawatambaisa, “Ni yumwe gatigati yenu nywie kumi dimwe na waidi, ni yuda agintae bumunda hamwe na mie mwe bakui. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Kwei Mwana wa Mntu aita kuuya na nyuma inga yekuandikwavyo mwe Maandiko ya Muungu, akini endaakione mntu yuda amhitukae Mwana wa Mntu! Ebae mntu uyo khekuwa avyaigiwe!”<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntafuno ya Zumbe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matayo 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Wakolinto 11:23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Wekuwaho wakada, Yesu akadoa bumunda akatogoa, akadibendua na kuwekha wahina wakwe, akamba, “Doani unu nee mwii wangu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Naho akadoa kikombe cha divai, akamtogoa Muungu na akawekha wose wakadomea kulawa mwe kikombe icho. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Akawamba, “Inu ne phome yangu ya Agane yetikayo kwaajii ya wantu wangi.” <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Nawamba kwei, “Khinanidomee vituhu divai inu ya mzabibu hadi misi ida nendayo nidomee uhya mwe Uzumbe wa Muungu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Naho wakatoa wiya, wakahauka wakaita kwe Muima wa Mizaituni.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aongoea kugombeka Petulo enda amuemee</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matayo 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohana 13:36-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Yesu akawamba wahina wakwe, “Nywie nyose mwendamnibade, kwaviya Maandiko ya Muungu yamba ‘Nenda nimtoe mwiisi, na ngoto zenda ziangadike uko na uko.’ <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Akini nendaho niyuyuke nenda niwaongoee kuda Galilaya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Petulo akamwamba Yesu, “Inga wose wendaho wakubade, mie khina nikubade katu!”<verse eid="MRK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Yesu akamwamba Petulo, “Kwei nakwamba kio iki, zogoo khadizatikukema maa mbii, wendauniemee maa ntatu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Akini petulo akaendeea kugombeka, “Hata inga nikakudigwa niuye na nyuma hamwe nawe, khina nikubade katu.” Naho Wahina wose wakagombeka inga ivyo.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu avika he kamnda ka Gesemane</para>
  <para style="s">Matayo 26:35-46; Luka 22:39-46</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Aho, wakabua he kamnda wetangwao Gesemane, Yesu akawamba wahina wakwe, “Ekaani aha, kisingi mie navika.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Naho akawadoa Petulo, na Yakobo na Yohana. Akavoka kuugumia muno mwe moyo wakwe na kuangadika. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Ne awamba, “Nina usungu mno mwe moyo wangu hehi na kunikoma. Mwekae aha na mwekae meso.”<verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Akaita mbee kidodo, aketambika asi akagonea ifu, akavika amba, ati ikadahika asekwembokea mda uwo wa suuba. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Akagombeka, “Abba, Tate mbui zose kwako zadahika. Uniusie kikombe iki, iya khio inga nikundavyo mie iya ukundavyo weye.”<verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Naho akauya na kuwabwiiya wada wahina wakwe watatu wagona, akawamba Petulo, “Simoni, kugona? Khamwekudaha kwekaa meso hata saa mwenga?” <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Naho akawamba, “Mwekae meso na kuvika mwesekweza kwengia mwe mageezo. Muye wakunda, iya mwii khauna udaho.”<verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Akenda kuvika vituhu na kuuiya mbui ziyaziya. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Naho akauya vituhu, akawabwiiya wagona kwaviya meso yao ne yamema usisiza, khawokumanya da kumtambaisa.<verse eid="MRK 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Ekwezaho maa ya ntatu akawamba, “Khamzati kwenuka na kuhumwiiza? Isasa enukani! Mda ubua kauwa, Mwana wa Mntu agewa mwe mikono ya wagosoao mavigaviga. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Enukani! Titeni! Kauwani, yuda mntu endaeanihituke yuhehi.”<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu agwiwa</para>
  <para style="s">Matayo 26:47-56; Luka 22:47-53; Yohana 18:3-12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Yesu ekuwaho agombeka, Yuda, yumwe wa wada wahina kumi dimwe na waidi akabua, keza hamwe na zumwezumwe da wantu wekwenuao mapaange na malungu. Wantu awo ne waagiiwa na waviki wakuu na wahinyi wa miko hamwe na wadaa wagookezi. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Naho Yuda Isikaliote nee kawekha utangio, “Nendaye nimuumbatie uyo mgwiieni na kumwiika asi ya ugoja.”<verse eid="MRK 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Yuda Isikaliote ekubuaho akaita kwa Yesu, akamwamba “Mhinyi!” Naho akamuumbatia. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Wada wantu wakamgwiya Yesu na kumwiika asi ya ugoja. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Yumwe da wada wekuwaho wagooka aho hamwe na Yesu, akasomoa paange dakwe akamtoa yumwe wa wandima wa mviki mkuu, akamsenga gutwi. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Naho Yesu akawamba, “Uwo mweza na mapaange na malungu kunigwiiya inga mie ni mhokaji? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Kia msi ni hamwe nanywi kahinya mwe Nyumba ya Muungu, khamwekunigwiya, akini isasa yakundigwa Maandiko ya Muungu yaiganie.”<verse eid="MRK 14:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Aho wahina wakwe wose wakambada na kuguuka. <verse eid="MRK 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Nekuwa na mbwanga yumwe ekuwaye akambasa Yesu nekavaa shuka ing'aayo. Naho wakageeza kumgwiiya. <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />Akini yee akachopoka na kuwabadia shuka ing'aayo, akaguuka kwesaho nguo.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu hemeso ya Baaza</para>
  <para style="s">Matayo 26:57-68; Luka 22:54-55, 63-71; Yohana 18:13-14,19-24</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Naho Yesu akegalwa mwe kaya ya mviki mkuu, aho akakintana na waviki wakuu wose, wadaa na wahinyi wa miko ne wakintana. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Petulo akambasa Yesu kwa hae, akengia mda mwe buha da mviki mkuu, akekaa hamwe na wasemgoja aotea moto. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Waviki wakuu na wantu wose wa baaza kuu wakoondeza, mbui zendazo zimtende Yesu akomwe, akini khawekupata. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Wantu wangi nee wagooka na kugombeka uhokho, akini mbui zao khazekuhigana.<verse eid="MRK 14:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Naho watuhu wakagooka wakagombeka uhokho, <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />“Timtegeeza mntu uyu akagombeka, ‘Nenda niibanange Nyumba inu ya Muungu yekuzengwayo na wantu, na kwa misi mitatu nendaniizenga tuhu yesayokuzengwa na wantu.’ ” <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Akini ata ivyo mbui zao khazekwevana.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Nee Mviki Mkuu akagooka hemeso yao akamuuza Yesu, “Wee khutambaisa mbui? Wantu awa waona mbwai kwako?”<verse eid="MRK 14:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Akini yee akanyamaa khekuandua hata mbui mwenga. Mviki Mkuu akamuuza vituhu, “Uwo wee nee Klistu, Mwana wa Muungu Mkuu?”<verse eid="MRK 14:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yesu akatambaisa, “Ehe, nee mie, na nywie mwendammwoone Mwana wa Mntu kekaa phande ya kuume ya Muungu mwenye udaho, eza na maangwi ya uwanga.”<verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Aho Mviki Mkuu akatatua khanzu yakwe, akamba, “Taonda mbui yani vituhu za kumkoea masa?” <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Mtegeezeni amdumuavyo Muungu. Nyie mwaona vivihi? Wose wakakunda akomwe.<verse eid="MRK 14:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Aho wamwe wa wantu wakavoka kumswiia ovu, wakamfunga buye, wakamtoa na kumwamba, “Otea ni ndai mwekukutoa!” Hata wakinasemgoja wakamdoa, wakamtoa vibao.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo amuemea Yesu</para>
  <para style="s">Matayo 26:69-75; Luka 22:56-62; Yohana 18:15-18, 25-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Petulo ekuwaho yu ahosi kwe buha, yumwe wa wandima wa kivyee wa Mviki Mkuu akeza. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Ekumuonaho Petulo aotea moto, akamkauwa akamwamba, “Hata wee nee uhamwe na Yesu Mnazaleti.”<verse eid="MRK 14:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Akini Petulo akaemea, “Hangi na khimanya ugombekayo!” Naho Petulo akahauka akaita hantu ha kwengiia, aho zogoo dikakema.<verse eid="MRK 14:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Yuda mndima ekumwonaho vituhu Petulo akavoka vituhu kuwamba wantu wekuwao wagooka aho, “Mntu uyu ni yumwe yao.” <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Petulo akaemea vituhu. Mda mcheche wantu wekuwaho wagooka aho wakamwamba Petulo, “Kwei wee ni yumwe yao, kwaajii wee ni Mgalilaya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Iya Petulo akavoka kweyapiza na kuaha akamba, “Miye khimmanya mntu uyu mgombekaye mbui zakwe.” <verse eid="MRK 14:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Aho zogoo akakema maa ya kaidi, Petulo akakumbuka viya Yesu ekuwavyo kamwamba, “Zogoo khadizati kukema maa mbii, wendauniemee maa ntatu.” Petulo akahomokeza mesozi.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s">Yesu egalwa kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="s">Matayo 27:1-2, 11-14; Luka 23:1-5; Yohana 18:28-38</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Kwekuchaho waviki wakuu na wadaa na wahinyi wa miko na Baaza kuu dose, wakamgea phingu Yesu wakamwegaa na kumwekhiiza kwa Pilato. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Pilato akamuuza Yesu, “Wee ni Seuta wa Wayahudi?” Yesu akamtambaisa, “Eeh inga ugombekavyo wee!”<verse eid="MRK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Waviki wakuu wakamuahia Yesu kwa mbui nyingi. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Pilato akamuuza vituhu Yesu, “khuna da kutambaisa? Kauwa wakusakiavyo mbui nyingi kwaajii yako.”<verse eid="MRK 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Akini Yesu khekutambaisa mbui hata Pilato akahondomaa.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amwiiwa ufe</para>
  <para style="s">Matayo 27:15-26; Luka 23:13-25; Yohana 18:39; 19:16</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Kia kisingi cha sikukhuu ya Pasaka, Pilato kawa na mazweea ya kuwavuguiya mfungwa yumwe wamkundaye. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Kisingi icho nekuwa na mntu yumwe etangwae Balaba, nee kafungwa hamwe na wantu wekuaho waemea uongooezi, naho nee wagosoa ukomaji kwe khumbizi. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Wantu wangi wakaita kwa Pilato wakamwombeza awagosoee inga yekuwavyo akawagosoea. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Pilato akawauza, “Mwakunda niwavuguiye Seuta wa Wayahudi?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Pilato kagombeka ivyo kwaajii kamanya pwii waviki wakuu wamwegaa Yesu kwakwe kwaajii ya kinyuu.<verse eid="MRK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Akini waviki wakuu wakawatenda wantu watoe vuzo ili wamwombeze Pilato awavuguiye Balaba. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Pilato akawauza wantu vituhu, isasa mwakunda nigosoe mbwai mntu uyu mwetangwae Seuta wa Wayahudi?<verse eid="MRK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Wantu wose wakatowa mgutio vituhu, “Mgong'ondeni kwe mhamba!” <verse eid="MRK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Akini Pilato akawauza, “Kwambwai! Kagosoa ufyaimu wani?” Akini wowo wakaendeea kutoa mgutio, “Mgong'ondeni he mhamba!”<verse eid="MRK 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Pilato akakunda kutamiza dia zumwezumwe da wantu. Aho nee amwekea Balaba kulawa mwe kifungo. Akakunda Yesu atoigwe ngoda wakabinda wamgong'ondee he mhamba.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asikai wambea Yesu</para>
  <para style="s">Matayo 27:27; Yohana 19:2-3</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Naho asikai wakamwegaa Yesu mwe buha da nyumba ya mkuu wa si ya Yudea, aho wakakintana kikosi kigima cha asikai. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Wakamvika gwanda da zambalau, wakagosoa kintu inga khofia ya useuta yekugosolwayo na miwa, wakamwiikia Yesu mwe mtwi wakwe. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Wakavoka kumuugusa, “Mwinyi Seuta wa Wayahudi!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Wakamtoa kwa ngoda ya lasi mwe mtwi, wakamswiia ovu, wakamkintia mavindi na kumwenamia. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Wekubindaho kumbea, wakamhambua dia gwanda da zambalau, wakamvika nguo zakwe, naho wakamlavya chongoi, wakamwegaa kumgong'ondea mwe mhamba.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu agong'ondewa he mhamba</para>
  <para style="s">Matayo 27:32-44; Luka 23:26-43; Yohana 19:17-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Wekuwaho siai, wakakintana na mntu yumwe etangwae Simoni, mwenyezi wa Kilene. Yee nee ni tate yao Alekizanda na Lufo na kisingi icho ne akalawa chongoi ya mzi. Nee asikai wamshutiza audoe mhamba wa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Naho wakamwegaa Yesu adi hantu hetangwaho Goligota, mana yakwe hantu ha Fufu da Mtwi. <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Wakamwekha divai yekuhanganywayo na mzigi wetangwao manemane, akini yee akaemea kuidomea. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Nee wamgong'ondea he mhamba, wakapangana nguo zakwe na kuzitoea kula kia yumwe adoe yakwe. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Neiwa saa ntatu da keo wekumgong'ondeavyo he mhamba. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Nee yagondwa masa yakwe ni, “Seuta wa Wayahudi.” <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Wamgong'ondea he mhamba na wahokaji waidi kia yumwe mhamba wakwe, yumwe phande ya kudiiya na mtuhu phande ya kumoso. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Aho Maandiko ya Muungu yakaigania yambayo, “Kaikwa kundi dimwe hamwe na wahokaji.”<verse eid="MRK 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Wantu wekuwao wemboka hantu hada wakamdumua wakasingisa mitwi yao na kugombeka, Ehee! Wee mtua Nyumba ya Muungu na kuizenga kwa misi mitatu. <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />Isasa weohoe mwenye seea he mhamba!<verse eid="MRK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Na viyaviya waviki wakuu hamwe na wahinyi wa miko wakammbea wakamba, “Kawaohoa wantu watuhu akini khadaha kweohoa mwenye!” <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Ati yee ni Klistu ekusagulwae ni Muungu, Seuta wa Isilaeli! Na asee kulawa he mhamba tione na kumzumiia hata wada wantu wekugong'ondwao wose he mhamba nae wakamdumua.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu auya na nyuma he Mhamba</para>
  <para style="s">Matendo 27:45-56; Luka 23:44-49; Yohana 19:28-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Kuvokea saa mtandatu wa musi adi saa kenda kiza kikuu kikagwa mwe si yose. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Saa kenda guoni Yesu akaiya kwa mgutio mkuu, akamba, “Eloi, Eloi, lama, Sabakitani?” Mana yakwe, “Muungu yangu, Muungu yangu mbona kunibada?”<verse eid="MRK 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Wamwe wa wantu wekugookao hada wekutegezaho ivyo wakamba, “Tegeeza! Amwetanga Elia.” <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Mntu yumwe akamgukia akaginta dodoki mwe divai yekusasayo, akaika uwanga ya lasi akamwekha adomee akamba, “Hembu timkaue ati Elia endaeze amseeze he mhamba!”<verse eid="MRK 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Yesu akakema kwa mgutio mkuu, akauya na nyuma.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Nee pazia kuu da Nyumba ya Muungu dikatatuka ntii mbii kulawa uwanga hadi asi. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Mkuu wa maasikai ekuwaye kagooka hemeso ya mhamba wa Yesu, ekuonaho Yesu kauya na nyuma kwa namna iyo, akamba kwei mntu uyu nekawa Mwana wa Muungu.<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Wawa aho wavyee wekukauwao kwa hae gatigati yao nee ni Maliamu Magidalena na Salome na Maliamu mami yakwe Yakobo mvunawe da Yusufu. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Awa ne wambasa Yesu ekuwaho Galilaya na kumwambiza. Nekuwa na wavyee watuhu wangi na wangi wekwezao Yelusalemu hamwe nae.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu agewa mwe mbia</para>
  <para style="s">Matayo 27:57-61; Luka 23:50-56; Yohana 19:38-42</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Kisingi cha guoni ne kibua kae, na iyo neiwa msi wa maandaiyo yani msi uongoao Msi wa Kuhumwiiza. <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Aho akeza Yusufu mwenyezi wa Alimatayo ne ni mntu wa Baaza kuu da Wayahudi, mtunywa muno. Yee pia nee akakauwiya kweza kwa Useuta wa Muungu. Nee aita kwa Pilato kwesiho kumwogoha, akamwombeza ekhigwe mwii wa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Pilato akahondomaa ekusikiaho kuwa Yesu kabindiikia kae kuuya na nyuma. Nee akamwetanga mkuu wa maasikai na kumuuza ati Yesu kauya kae na nyuma mwandoose. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Pilato ekwembigwaho na uyo mkuu wa maasikai Yesu kauya kae na nyuma, akamkunda Yusufu adoe mwii wakwe. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Aho Yusufu akagua sanda, akauseeza asi uwo mwii akauvungavunga sanda. Akauwiika mwe mbia dekuwado digosolwa kwe iwe cha ukuu naho akatongoosa iwe kuu hemeso ya uvi. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Na Maliamu Magidalena na Maliamu mami yakwe da Yusufu wakahaona aho ekugonezwaho.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s">Kuyuyuka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="s">Matayo 28:1-8; Luka 24:1-12; Yohana 20:1-10</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Msi wa Kuhumwiiza yekwembokayo Maliamu Magidalena na Salome na Maliamu mami yakwe da Yakobo wakagua mavuta matana, ili wakausise mwii wa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Keo da mtungaihu msi wa bosi wa juma wakabua he mbia zua dekuvokaho kulawa. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Naho wekuwaho siai nee watamwiiya, “Nndai mwendaatiusie dia iwe he uvi wa mbia?” <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Akini wekukauwaho wakoona iwe diusigwa kae nado nee diwa kuu muno. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Wekwengiaho mda mwe mbia wakomwona mbwanga yumwe kavaa khanzu yekung'aayo kekaa phande ya kuume wakahondomaa muno.<verse eid="MRK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Akini uyo mbwanga akawamba, “Msekuhondomaa. Mwamwondeza Yesu wa Nazaleti mwekugong'ondewa he mhamba. Kayuyuka, khayuho aha, kauwani hantu ekugonezwaho. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Hitani mkawambe wahina wakwe hamwe na Petulo awaongweea kuita Galilaya. Uko mwendammwone inga ekuwagombekeavyo.”<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Naho wakalawa hada he mbia na uguuko, mana nee wakazingiza kwa maatu na kuhondomaa khawekumgombekea mntu yoyose mbui iyo, kwaajii waogoha mno.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amwawiiya Maliamu mntu wa Magidala</para>
  <para style="s">Matayo 28:9-10; Yohana 20:11-18</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Yesu ekuyuyukaho msi wa bosi wa juma aho akeonyesha kwa Maliamu Magidalena, ambae Yesu kamlavya mazaiko mfungate. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Maliamu Magidalena akaita, akawamanyisa wada wekuwaho wakitongeana na Yesu na kisingi icho newawa na bwaimbo na kuiya. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Akini wekusikiaho Yesu yu mgima ati Maliamu Magidalena kamwoona, khawokumzumiiya.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awalawiiya wahina waidi</para>
  <para style="s">Luka 24:13-35</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Yekwembokaho ayo Yesu akawalawia wahina waidi kwa cheni kituhu. Wahina awo newawa wakaita chongoi ya mzi. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Naho wakaita kuwamba wezwao akini wowo khawokuwazumiiya.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awalawiia wahina kumi dimwe na mwenga</para>
  <para style="s">Matayo 28:16-20; Luka 24:36-49; Yohana 20:19-23; Matendo 1:6-8</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Mda mcheche Yesu akawalawia wahina kumi dimwe na mwenga wekuwaho hamwe wakada khande. Akawaakia muno kwaajii ya kwesekuzumiiya kwao na khani zao, mana khawokuwazumiiya wada wekuwao wamwona bada ya kuyuyuka. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Aho akawamba, “Hitani mwe inusi yose mkabiikie Mbui Yedi kwa wantu wose. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Mwendaazumiiye na kubatizwa endaaoholwe. Mwesekuzumiiya endaaamuiiwe. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Na vihii ivi vyenda vitongeane na wada wazumiiyao kwa zina dangu. Wenda walavye mazaiko na wendawatamwiiye kwa vitamwiiwavyo vihya. <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />Wendawatoze nyoka au kudomea kintu chochose cha kukoma khakina kiwakome, wendawawaikie watamu mikono nao wendawahone.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu adoigwa kwe maangwi</para>
  <para style="s">Luka 24:50-53; Matendo 1:9-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Naho Zumbe Yesu ekubindaho kugombeka nao akadoigwa kwe maangwi akekaa phande ya kuume ya Muungu. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Wahina wakaita wakabiikia kia hantu, Zumbe akagosoa ndima hamwe nao kuika vitana mbui izo kwa vihii vyekutongeanavyo nao.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>